  <para style="h">Akpa Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <para style="toc1">Akpa Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akpa Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ndi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Akpa Ñwed Ndidem</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Adọniya Anịm Idem Amọ Nte Adidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Ke ini Adidem Defid amaakenekke asọñ, anye ikikanna ikop ufiob akpesʌkado ekefuuhọ anye mme uwak afọñ. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Ndin mme anamutom amọ ete anye, “Yak ñnyịn iyem ñkpʌk abọikpa i-imiidiọọñọke awodeen kpaanam adiba ye adidem anyʌñ ase ñkpọ abaña anye. Anye akeme adisuuk nnaa ndiana anye yak abọọñ kpa adidem ñnyịn akop ufiob.”<verse eid="1KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Ndin ammọ emaeyeem uyaiya abọikpa ke afịd Isrel ekekịt Abisak, awonwaan Sunem, eben anye esọk adidem. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Abọikpa ami amaayaiya eti-eti; anye amaase ñkpọ abaña adidem anyʌñ anam ñkpọ anọ adidem, ado adidem ikinieghe ewuana ye anye.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Ndin Adọniya, e-eka amọ akedooho Hakịd, amaasio idem amọ anyan anyʌñ abo, “Ami ñyaado adidem.” Ndin anye amaadat mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara, ye ideen aba mme duob efeeñe anye ke iso. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />(Kpaanam ete amọ ikisuaha inọ anye ibịp ibo, “Nsoo ido ntak afo asinamma ntom?” Anye ñko amaayaiya eti-eti ndin ekeman anye edian Absalọm.)<verse eid="1KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adọniya amaadʌk adu ye Yoab ayịn Seruya ye aku Abiata, ammọ emaenọ anye ibededem. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Ado aku Sadọk, Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada, ekamba prọfed Natan, Simei, Rei ye asaña-asaña ukpeme Defid ikikeeneke Adọniya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Adọniya amaawa mme edọñ, mme enañ ye mme ukọkʌk ñyịn enañ ke Itiad Soheled a-akpereke En Rokel. Anye amaakoot afịd nditọeka amọ ideen, nditọ ideen adidem, ye afịd mme adaaha adidem ke Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />ado anye ikikoodo Natan ekamba prọfed me Benaiya me asaña-asaña ukpeme adidem me ayịnete amọ Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Ndin Natan amaabịp Bedseba, eka Sọlọmọn, “Ado nte afo ukoppo ke Adọniya, ayịn Hakịd, adido adidem, ndin abọọñ ñnyịn Defid idiọọñọke ñkpọ ndomokeed ibaña? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Idahami, yak unọ fiin item naña uduukan unyaaña uwem mfo ye ake ayịn mfo Sọlọmọn. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Dʌk bịne Adidem Defid nyʌñ bo anye, ‘Abọọñ mmi adidem, afo ukunwọñọke unọ afʌnanwaan mfo ubo: “Ke akpanikọ Sọlọmọn ayịn mfo adiidat itie mmi nte adidem, ndin anye adiitie ke ebekpo mmi”? Nsoo ido ntak ndin yak Adọniya akappa ado adidem?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Ke ini asʌkkọ atañ ikọ ado ye adidem ami ñyaadʌk ndidian uyio ke se afo atañ.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Ndin Bedseba amaadʌk akekịt adidem amaakesọñ ke ubeed amọ, ke ini Abisak awonwaan Sunem akesʌkkọ ase ñkpọ abaña anye. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Bedseba amaasuuk iwuod anyanna anaa ke iso adidem.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 1:16">Adidem amaabịp anye abo, “Nsoo ke afo ayem?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Anye amaabo anye ate, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> mmi, afo ke idem mfo amaanwọñọ annọ miin afʌnanwaan mfo ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo: ‘Sọlọmọn ayịn mfo adiidat itie mmi nte adidem, ndin anye adiitie ke ebekpo mmi.’ <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Ado idahami Adọniya ado adidem, ndin afo, abọọñ mmi adidem, udiọọñọke ubaña. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Anye a-awa uwak ibad enañ, mme ukọkʌk ñyịn enañ, ye mme edọñ, anyʌñ akoot afịd nditọ ideen adidem, aku Abiata ye Yoab adaiso udịmekọñ, ado ikoodo Sọlọmọn afʌnadeen mfo. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> adidem mmi, anyen afịd Isrel use fiin, edidiọọñọ uto fiin awo se idiitie ke ebekpo mfo abọọñ adidem mi. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Ke imiidooho ntoro, ke emaefọfʌk abọọñ kpa adidem iso nọ akeduọk adudu ye mme ete amọ, edimbat miin ye ayịn mmi Sọlọmọn nte mme abiad mbed.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Ke ini anye asʌkkọ atatañ ikọ ye adidem, prọfed Natan amaadisịm. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Ndin emaedọkkọ adidem ete, “Prọfed Natan mmọ mi aba.” Ndin anye amaadʌk ke iso adidem anyuuk iwuod anyʌñ asuuk iso ke isọñ.<verse eid="1KI 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Natan amaabo ate, “Nte afo, abọọñ mmi adidem, amebiide ke Adọniya adiidat itie mfo nte adidem umauboiyo ufep, ndin ke anye adiitie ke ebekpo mfo? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Mfịn ami anye a-akaa akewa uwak ibad enañ, mme ukọkʌk ñyịn enañ ye mme edọñ. Anye akoot afịd nditọ ideen adidem, mme adaiso udịmekọñ ye aku Abiata. Kpa ke idahami ammọ esʌk edia enyʌñ enwọñ ye anye enyʌñ ebo, ‘Itọñ uwem asọñ Adidem Adọniya!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Ado ami afʌnadeen mfo, ye aku Sadọk, ye Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada, ye afʌnadeen mfo Sọlọmọn anye ikikoodo. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Se abọọñ mmi adidem anam ado ami, imiiyakka mbon amọ ediọọñọ awo se idiitie ke ebekpo abọọñ mmi adidem ke anye amaaboiyo ifep?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Defid anam Sọlọmọn Adidem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Ndin Adidem Defid amaabo, “Ikoot Bedseba adi.” Ndin anye amaadʌk adi iso adidem anyʌñ ada ke iso amọ.<verse eid="1KI 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Ndin adidem amaadat unwọñọ: “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho, amfakka miin asio ke afịd afanekọñ, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />ami ñyaanam mfịn ami se ami ñkenwọñọ unọọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel: Sọlọmọn ayịn mfo abiido adidem ke ami mmaadakka, ndin anye adiitie ke ebekpo ke itie mmi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Ndin Bedseba amaasuuk iwuod ye iso amọ ke isọñ, anyanna anaa ke iso adidem, amaanyʌñ abo, “Yak abọọñ mmi Adidem Defid adu ke nsi-nsi!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Adidem Defid amaabo, “Ikoot aku Sadọk, prọfed Natan ye Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada edʌk edi.” Ke ini ammọ emaekedʌk ke iso adidem, <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />anye amaabo ammọ: “Idat ifʌn nditọ abọọñ ndufo ndin inam Sọlọmọn ayịn mmi adọọk ñwaahadọñki mmi ndin iben anye ikaa ke Kihọn. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Ke udo inam Sadọk aku ye prọfed Natan eyet anye adan nte adidem Isrel. Ifịt adukpoñ inyʌñ isio ñkpo, ‘Itọñ uwem asọñ Adidem Sọlọmọn!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Ndin ana ndufo edọọk ye anye, ndin ana anye adidat itie ke ebekpo mmi anyʌñ akaara ke itie mmi. Ami mmemek anye andikara ke Isrel ye Yuda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada amaabọọrọ adidem ate, “Amen! Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi abọọñ mmi adidem, asọọñọ ntoro. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeba ye abọọñ mmi adidem, kpa ntoro yak anye aba ye Sọlọmọn anam ebekpo amọ akpon akan ebekpo abọọñ mmi adidem Defid!”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Ndin aku Sadọk, prọfed Natan, Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada, ye mbon Kered ye mbon Peled emaekaa ekenam Sọlọmọn adọọk dọñki Adidem Defid, ndin ammọ emaesaña ye anye ekaa Kihọn. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Aku Sadọk amaaben adan ke nnʌk ke adisana afe amaanyʌñ ayet Sọlọmọn adan. Ndin ammọ emaefịt adukpoñ ndin afịd awo esio ñkpo ete, “Itọñ uwem asọñ Adidem Sọlọmọn!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Ndin afịd awo emaekeene anye edọọk, ekama adʌk ebre enyʌñ edaara eti-eti, anam isọñ anyeñ ato uyom idaara.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Adọniya ye afịd mme isenawo e-ekebaaha ye anye emaekop uyom ado kpa ke idaha ammọ ekekweeñeke usọrọ ammọ. Ke edikop uyio adukpoñ, Yoab amaabịp ate, “Nsoo ke afịd ñkpoyo ke abio ada anọ?”<verse eid="1KI 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Kpa naña anye asʌkkọ atatañ ke inua, Yọnatan ayịn aku Abiata amaadisịm. Adọniya amaabo, “Dʌk di. Eti awo nte afo ana aben eti etob adi.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />“Idooho ntoro-o!” Yọnatan amaabọọrọ Adọniya. “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyịn Adidem Defid anam Sọlọmọn adidem. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Adidem adọñ aku Sadọk, prọfed Natan, Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada, mbon Kered ye mbon Peled, ndin ammọ edot anye ke ñwaahadọñki adidem, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />ndin aku Sadọk ye prọfed Natan eyet anye adan nte adidem ke Kihọn. Ammọ eto edọọk esio ñkpo, afịd abio asịkke. Anye ado uyom ake ndufo ekoppo do. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Ñko, Sọlọmọn adat itie amọ ke ebekpo ubọọñ. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Ñko, mme adaaha adidem edi edikọọm abọọñ ñnyịn Adidem Defid, ete, ‘Yak Abasi mfo anam anyịñ Sọlọmọn awuọ etob akan ake mfo ndin yak ebekpo amọ akpon akan ake mfo!’ Ndin adidem amaasuuk iwuod ke ukpono ke akwañ amọ <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />ndin abo, ‘Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, a-anamma nọ anyen mmi akịt andidad itie ke ebekpo mmi mfịn ami.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Ke ami, afịd mme isenawo Adọniya emaedaaña ke ñnyeñidem enyʌñ esuana. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Ado Adọniya, ke ndịk Sọlọmọn, amaakeyịre amʌm mme nnʌk akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Emaedọkkọ Sọlọmọn, “Adọniya akop ndịk Adidem Sọlọmọn ndin mmọdo ayịre ke mme nnʌk akpokoro uwa. Anye abo, ‘Yak adidem Sọlọmọn anwọñọ annọ miin mfịn ami abo ke imọ idiñwotto miin ke akañkañ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Sọlọmọn amaabọọrọ, “Adieke anye adooho awo ukpono, ided amọ ndomokeed idiiduọhọ ke isọñ; ado adieke idiọọk abaaha anye ke idem, anye ayaakpa.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Ndin Adidem Sọlọmọn amaadọñ ideen, ndin eketat anye ke akpokoro uwa eben edi. Ndin Adọniya amaadi adisuuk iwuod anọ Adidem Sọlọmọn, ndin Sọlọmọn amaabo, “Nyọñ ufọk mfo.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Item ake Defid Anọọhọ Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Akekpere ini Defid ayemme adikpa, anye amaanọ Sọlọmọn ayịn amọ awodeen item.<verse eid="1KI 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />Anye amaabo, “Ami ñyaaka usʌñ afịd ederimbod,” “Ke ntoro sọñ idem, ba nte awodeen, <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />nyʌñ nam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ayem: Saña ke ñkobitem nọ anye, nyʌñ nịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme item amọ, mme mbed ye ubonoñkpọ amọ, kpa naña ewet ke Mbed Moses. Nam ami nọ ato do afo anie edikan ke afịd se afo anam ye itie akeedodo afo aforo ke afịd se afo anam ye ke itie akeedodo a-afo akaaha <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />ñko ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akpekap anịm enwọñọ amọ annọ miin: ‘Adieke ubon mfo ekpemeke naña ammọ edu uwem, ñko adieke ammọ esañake ke akpanikọ ke iso mmi ke afịd esịd ye afịd ukpọñ ammọ, afo uduutreke adinie awo se idiidat itie mfo ke ebekpo Isrel.’<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />“Idahami afo ke idem mfo amediọọñọ se Yoab ayịn Seruya akennam miin ye se anye akenam mme adaiso ekọñ iba ke udịmekọñ Isrel, Abna ayịn Nee ye Amasa ayịn Yeta. Anye amaawot ammọ, aduọk iyiib ammọ ke ini emem nte akedo ini ekọñ, ndin ye iyiib ado anye amaakpenne mbọbọisịn ye ikpaukod ke ukod amọ. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Nam ye anye keene aniọñ mfo, ado kuuyak iwuod iwad amọ aka udi ke emem.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />“Ado fọn ido ye nditọ ideen Basilai a-atooho Kilied nyʌñ yak ammọ edo mbon se iwuana ubọk ndidia ye afo. Ammọ emaebere ye ami idaha a-ami ñkefegheke mbọkkọ Absalọm ayịnete mfo.<verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />“Nyʌñ toiyo ke afo amenie Simei ayịn Kera, awo Benyamin a-atooho Bahurim, a-akensuuñọke miin usen ami ñkekaaha Mahanaim. Ke ini anye akedinsooboke miin ke inyañ Yọdan, ami mmaanwọñọ nnọ anye ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: ‘Ami nduuwotto fiin ke akañkañ.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Ado idahami, kuudat anye nte idueghe. Afo ado awo aniọñ; afo ayaadiọọñọ se anam ye anye. Ben iwuod iwad amọ kaa udi ke afai.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Ndin Defid amaadaiya ye mme ete amọ, emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Abio Defid. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Defid amaakara Isrel ke isua aba, isua itiaba ke Hibrọn adian edịb mme duob mme ita ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaatie ke ebekpo ete amọ Defid, emaenyʌñ esọọñọ ukara amọ.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebekpo Sọlọmọn Asọọñọ Ada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Ndin Adọniya, ayịn Hakịd, amaakaa abịne Bedseba, eka Sọlọmọn. Bedseba amaabịp anye, “Afo adi ke emem?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ntoro, ndi ke emem.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Ndin anye amaadian, “Ami mmenie se ñyem itañ ye afo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Afo amekeme itañ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Anye amaabo ate, “Kpa naña afo adiọọñọ, abioubọọñ ado akennie miin. Afịd Isrel ekense miin nte adidem ammọ. Ado ñkpọ amaakpuuñọ, ndin abioubọọñ abịne ayịnete mmi; sia akeene anye ato <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Idahami ami mmenie ebeeñe keed uto fiin. Kunsịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Anye amaabo, “Afo amekeme adibeeñe.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Anye amaakaa iso, “Mbọk beeñe Adidem Sọlọmọn, anye iduusịnne fiin, annọ Abisak awonwaan Sunem nte anwaan mmi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Bedseba amaabọọrọ, “Afọn, ñyaaneme nnọ adidem ke iwuod mfo.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Ke ini Bedseba akekaaha aditañ ikọ ye Adidem Sọlọmọn mbaña Adọniya, adidem amaadakka ada akaa adisoobo ye anye, anyuuk iwuod ke isọñ anọ anye anyʌñ akesuuk atie ke ebekpo amọ. Anye amaanam yak eben ebekpo esọk eka abọọñ, ndin anye amaasuuk atie ke ubọk nnasia amọ.<verse eid="1KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Anye amaabo, “Ami mmenie etək ebeeñe edinịm ke iso mfo. Mbọk kunsịn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Adidem amaabọọrọ, “Nam ebeeñe mfo, eka mmi; ami nduusịnne.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Ndin anye amaabo ate, “Yak eben Abisak awonwaan Sunem enọ ayịnete mfo Adọniya ke ndọ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaabọọrọ eka amọ, “Ntak a-afo abeeñeke Abisak awonwaan Sunem anọọ Adọniya-a? Akpena akap abeeñe abioubọọñ ñko anọ anye, ke aditịm ntañ anye ansọñ miin, ii, beeñe nọ anye ye aku Abiata ye Yoab ayịn Seruya!”<verse eid="1KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Ndin Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanwọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: “Yak Abasi anam ye ami, adọdiọọk akan ado, adieke Adọniya imiikpeeghe ye uwem amọ ke ebeeñe ami! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Ndin idahami, adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho, andinsọọñọ miin ke ebekpo ete mmi Defid anyʌñ anam ubon annọ naña anye akenwọñọ, Adọniya ana akpa mfịn ami!” <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Ndin Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanọ Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada uyio, ndin anye amaakewot Adọniya.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Adidem amaabo aku Abiata, “Tịmme nyọñ kaa mme inwañ mfo ke Anatod. Amedot ñkpa, ado nduuwotto idahami, sia afo akebiom akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara ke iso ete mmi Defid anyʌñ akeene ayọ afịd ukuud ete mmi.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaasio Abiata ke atu mme aku <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anam ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ke Silo abaña ufọk Elai, adisu.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Ke ini etob akewuọhọ Yoab, a-akedianake ye Adọniya ado idooho ye Absalọm, anye amaafeghe akaa atayad <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeyịre amʌm nnʌk akpokoro uwa. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Emaedọkkọ Adidem Sọlọmọn ke Yoab afeghe aketʌmọ atayad <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke mben akpokoro uwa. Ndin Sọlọmọn amaanọ Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada uyio ate, “Kaa, kewot anye!”<verse eid="1KI 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Ndin Benaiya amaadʌk atayad <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo Yoab, “Adidem abo, ‘Wuọ di!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Ado anye amaabọọrọ, “Iyoo, ami mbiikpa ke mmi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaiya amaakedọkkọ adidem ate, “Kop mi se Yoab ambọọrọ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Ndin adidem amaanọ Benaiya uyio ate, “Nam se anye abo. Yʌppọ anye wot nyʌñ buuk anye, ndin ami ye afịd ufọk mmi imisana ke iyiib Yoab akeduọkkọ. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaanọ anye utịb ke iyiib anye akeduọkkọ, sia ete mmi Defid ikidiọọñọke ke anye akefʌk ideen iba awot ke eduad. Awo iba ado, Abna ayịn Nee, adaiso udịmekọñ Isrel, ye Amasa ayịn Yeta, adaiso udịmekọñ Yuda ekedoñño nti ibon enyʌñ efọn ekan anye. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Yak ndudue iyiib ammọ adoro Yoab ye ubon amọ ke nsi-nsi. Ado amaado Defid ye ubon amọ, ufọk amọ ye ebekpo amọ, yak emem <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aba ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Ndin Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada amaadọọk akaa akekịm Yoab anyʌñ awot anye, ndin emaebuuk anye ke atʌñ amọ ke esịdidʌñ. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Adidem amaanam Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada adaiso ke udịmekọñ ke itie Yoab anyʌñ anịm aku Sadọk ke itie Abiata.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Ndin adidem amaadọñ ekoot Simei anyʌñ abo anye, “Bọp ufọk nọ idem mfo ke Yeruselem nyʌñ dʌñ do, kuukaa itie mfen. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Usen umaukpọñ ukaaña Abedeñ Kidrọn, diọọñọ ke ayaakpa; iyiib mfo adiidoro ke iwuod mfo.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Simei amaabọọrọ adidem ate, “Se afo atañ afọn. Afʌnadeen mfo ayaanam naña abọọñ mmi adidem atañ.” Ndin Simei amaadʌñ ke Yeruselem ke anyan ini.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Ado isua ita akeboiyo, ifʌn Simei ita emaefeeñe ebịne Akis ayịn Maaka, adidem Kad, ndin emaedọkkọ Simei ete, “Mme ifʌn mfo eba ke Kad.” <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Ke ami, anye amaadọọk dọñki amọ akaa abịne Akis ke Kad adikiyem mme ifʌn amọ. Ndin Simei amaakaa akekoono mme ifʌn ado ato adi ke Kad.<verse eid="1KI 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Ekedọkkọ Sọlọmọn ke Simei amaakpọñ Yeruselem akaa Kad anyʌñ anyọñ adi, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />adidem amaadọñ ekoot Simei anyʌñ adibo anye ate, “Nte ami ñkenamma nọ afo anwọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ñnyʌñ udʌt fiin utọñ nte, ‘Ke usen afo umaukpọñ ukaa itie ndomokeed mfen, ana afo adiọọñọ ke afo ayaakpa’? Ini ado afo akembo miin, ‘Se afo atañ afọn. Ami ñyaakop.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Nsoo ido ntak ake afo umuukunịmme enwọñọ mfo unọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> unyʌñ unam item ake ami ñkunọọhọ fiin?”<verse eid="1KI 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Adidem amaamaana adian abo Simei, “Afo amediọọñọ ke esịd mfo afịd idiọọkñkpọ se afo akenam ete mmi Defid. Idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayausio fiin usiene idiọọkñkpọ mfo. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Ado eyaediọñ Adidem Sọlọmọn, ndin ebekpo Defid ayaasọọñọ ada ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="1KI 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Ndin adidem amaanọ Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada uyio, ndin anye awuọ akaa akeyʌppọ Simei anye akpa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Abioubọọñ ndin amaasọọñọ ada ke ubọk Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Sọlọmọn Abeeñe Aniọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Sọlọmọn amaanam edioomo ye Fero adidem Iyib anyʌñ adọ ayịn amọ awonwaan. Anye amaaben anye adi Abio Defid tutu anye akekweeñe adibọp ufọk amọ ye itieukpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ye ndibene akannake Yeruselem. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Mbon awo ekesʌk ewawa uwa ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, sia awo imiikibọppọ itieukpono inọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> kaña. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Sọlọmọn amaawọt ima a-anye akenieghe anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke adisaña ke item ete amọ Defid akenọọhọ anye, ukweeñe ado ke anye akewa uwa ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Adidem amaakaa Kibiọn adikiwa uwa, sia itie ado akedo ataa akpan ñkoñ-ñkoñ itieukpono, ndin Sọlọmọn amaawa ufọfọb uwa tọsịn keed (1,000) ke itieukpono ado. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Ke Kibiọn <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabiọññọ anọ Sọlọmọn ke ndab ke akonayio, ndin Abasi amaabo, “Beeñe ñkpọ akeedodo afo ayemme nọ ami unọ fiin.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Sọlọmọn amaabọọrọ, “Afo amefọn eti-eti ye afʌnadeen mfo, ete mmi Defid, sia anye amaanam akpanikọ unọ fiin anyʌñ asaña nnekke-nnekke anyʌñ anie eti esịd. Afo ameka iso afọn ekamba mfọn ami anọ anye anyʌñ anọ anye ayịn aditie ke ebekpo amọ ke usen mfịn ami.<verse eid="1KI 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />“Idahami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi, Afo amenam afʌnadeen mfo adidem ke itie ete mmi Defid. Ado ami ndo ataa etəkayịn ñnyʌññọ ndiọọñọ naña ñkpenam mme utom ukara mmi. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Afʌnadeen mfo aba mi ke atu ikọd mfo ake afo amekke, uwak-uwak udịm awo, ewak ekan se ekpebat. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Ke ntoro nọ afʌnadeen mfo esịd ikike se adiidat ikara ikọd mfo anyʌñ adiọọñọ se ido eti ye idiọọk. Sia anie ikan ikara utọ udịm mbon mfo ami?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanem esịd ke se Sọlọmọn akebeeñe ado ami. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Ndin Abasi amaabo anye, “Sia afo abeeñeke ami ado ubeeñeke anyan uwem me inie unọ idem mfo, unyʌññọ ubeeñe ñkpa unọ mme asua mfo ado abeeñe ikike se akara ke unen, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />ami ñyaanam se afo abeeñe. Ami ñyaunọ esịd aniọñ ye ikike, nọ ato do awo ndomokeed ibaaha nte afo, inyʌññọ idiibaba. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Ñko, ami ñyaunọ fiin se afo umuubeeñeke, ke inie ye ke ukpono, nọ ato do ke ayio uwem mfo afo uduunieghe udian ke atu mme ndidem. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Ndin adieke afo asañake ke ñkobitem mmi anyʌñ anịm mme ewʌhọ mmi ye item mmi naña Defid ete mfo akenam, ami ñyaunọ anyan uwem.” <verse eid="1KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaademme adikịt ke ndab ke akedo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:15">Anye amaatịmme anyọñ Yeruselem, akeda ke iso akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ awa mme ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ewuana. Ndin anye amaanam usọrọ anọ afịd awo ke akwere amọ.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubiereikpe Asañake ye Aniọñ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Akekem ibaan akpara iba emaedi ebịne adidem enyʌñ edida ke iso amọ. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Keed ke atu ammọ amaabo, “Mbọk ke ukpono abọọñ mmi. Awonwaan ami ye ami idʌñ ke ufọk keed, ndin ami mmaaman ayịn ke anye akebaaha ye ami. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Usen ita amaakeboiyo tọọñọ ayịn mmi akemana, awonwaan ami amaanyʌñ aman ayịn. Ñnyịn ikpọọñ ikiba; awo mfen ikibaaha ke ufọk ibọhọke ñnyịn awo iba.<verse eid="1KI 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />“Ke akonayio ayịn mma ami amaakpa sia anye amaafiik anye anaa. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Ndin anye amaadakka ada ke ufọọd akonayio anyʌñ aben ayịn mmi adiañña ke ñkañ mmi idaha afʌnanwaan mfo amaakedaiya. Anye amaanịm anye adian eba amọ ndin aben adukpo ayịn amọ anịm adian eba mmi. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Ayio akesiere, ami mmaademme adinọ ayịn mmi eba, ndin anye amaakpa! Ado ñkesuuk anyen nnekke nse anye ke unwana usiere, ami ndidiọọñọ ke idooho ayịn añkemanna ke ado.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Mma anye ako amaabo, “Iyoo! Aduuwem ado ayịn mmi; adukpo ayịn ado ake mfo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Ado akpa awo amaasọọñọ ayịre, “Iyoo! Adukpo ado ake mfo; aduuwem ado ake mmi.” Ammọ emaekaa iso efaaña ntoro ke iso adidem.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Adidem amaabo, “Anye ami ate, ‘Ayịn mmi ado aduuwem ndin ayịn mfo ado adukpo,’ ndin anye ako ate, ‘Iyoo! Ayịn mfo amaakpa ndin ake mmi ado aduuwem.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Ndin adidem amaabo, “Innọ miin akañkañ.” Ndin emaeben akañkañ esọk adidem. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Adidem amaanọ uyio: “Kpịkke aduuwem ayịn ado ke itie iba nyʌñ nọ awo keed ubaak keed nyʌñ nọ awo anye ako ubaak.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Mma anye a-ayịn amọ akedooho aduuwem amaakop mbọm abaña ayịn amọ ato ke ima a-anye akenieghe anọ ayịn amọ ndin anye amaabo adidem, “Mbọk, abọọñ mmi, yaak aduuwem ayịn ado nọ anye! Kuuwot ayịn ado!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Ado mma anye ako amaabo, “Ñnyịn ndomokeed idiinieghe anye. Bakka anye ke itie iba!”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Ndin adidem amaanọ ubiideikpe amọ: “Yaak aduuwem ayịn nọ akpa awonwaan. Kuuwot anye; anye ado eka amọ.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Ke ini afịd Isrel ekekoppo ubiideikpe adidem akenọọhọ, ammọ emaeteeñe adidem, sia emaekịt ke anye akebọ aniọñ ato Abasi adikpe unen.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Adaaha ye Mme Ñkpisọñ Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Ndin Adidem Sọlọmọn amaakaara ke afịd Isrel.<verse eid="1KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Mme adaaha amọ ekedoñño ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:2">Asaria ayịn Sadọk, aku;<verse eid="1KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Elihoreb ye Ahiya, nditọ ideen Sisa, mme awedñwed;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:3">Yehosafad ayịn Ahilud, awedmbʌk;<verse eid="1KI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Benaiya ayịn Yehoiyada, adaiso udịmekọñ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:4">Sadọk ye Abiata, mme aku;<verse eid="1KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Asaria ayịn Natan, andiseghe ñkpọ abaña mme adaiwuod ukara;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:5">Sabud ayịn Natan, aku ye anọitem adidem;<verse eid="1KI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahisa, andise ñkpọ mbaña ukara esịdufọk adidem;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:6">Adọniram ayịn Abda, aseñkpọ mbaña ufefiik utom isọñabio.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Sọlọmọn akenie mme adaaha duob mme iba ke afịd Isrel, e-ekenọọhọ ñkpọ ndidia ye afịd ñkpọ adidem ye esịd ufọk adidem. Awo keed akena anọ ñkpọ se eyem akem afiọñ keed ke isua.<verse eid="1KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Mme anyịñ ammọ edoñño ami:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:8">Ben-Họọ ke abod abio Ifrem;<verse eid="1KI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Ben-Deke, ke Makas, Saalbịm, Bed Semes ye Elon Bedhanan;<verse eid="1KI 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Ben-Hesed, ke Arubod (Soko ye afịd isọ Hefa ekenie anye);<verse eid="1KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Ben-Abinadab, ke Nafọd Dọọ (anye akedọ Tafad ayịn awonwaan Sọlọmọn);<verse eid="1KI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Baana ayịn Ahilud, ke Taanak ye Mekido, ye ke afịd Bed San a-adianake Saretan ke idak Yesriil, tọọñọ ke Bed San tutu Ebeel Mehola tutu ke Yekameem;<verse eid="1KI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Ben-Kebe, ke Ramọd Kilied (mme itieidʌñ Yai ayịn Manase ke Kilied ekedo ake amọ, adian ye Arkob ke Basan ye mme abio ammọ ata e-ebọppọ ikpọ ndibene ekanna ye inuaatob akpoho);<verse eid="1KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Ahinadab ayịn Iddo, ke Mahanaim;<verse eid="1KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaas, ke Naftali (anye akedọ Basemad ayịn awonwaan Sọlọmọn);<verse eid="1KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Baana ayịn Husai, ke Asaa ye ke Alọd;<verse eid="1KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Yehosafad ayịn Parua, ke Isaka;<verse eid="1KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Simei ayịn Ela, ke Benyamin;<verse eid="1KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Kebe ayịn Uri, ke Kilied (idịd Sihọn adidem mbon Amọọ ye idịd Ọk adidem Basan). Anye ikpọọñ akedo adaaha ke efaak ado.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpọ Ndidia ye Ñkpọufọk se Sọlọmọn Ayem ke Usen ke Usen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Mbon Yuda ye Isrel emaewak nte ntan mben akpa; ammọ emaedia, emaenwọñ enyʌñ ekop inemesịd. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaakaara ke mme idịd tọọñọ ke Inyañ Yufretis tutu ke isọñ mbon Filistia, tutu ke adaña Iyib. Mme idịd ami emaeben utomo enyʌñ esuuk iwuod enam ñkpọ enọ Sọlọmọn ke afịd ayio uwem amọ.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Ndidia Sọlọmọn ke usen ke usen akedo udomo kọọ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 5 1/2 me metrịk tọọn 5</char></note> ndomuyo edịb mme duob ye udomo uyo kọọ ata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 11 me metrịk tọọn 10</char></note>, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />enañ duob edọññọ ndidia ke usịnudia enọ, enañ edịb e-enọọhọ mbid ke anwa ye edọñ ye ebod ikie, ye ebed, edob, akoyo ye mme asaña-asaña unen. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Sia Sọlọmọn amaakaara ke mme idịd ke usobutịn Inyañ Yufretis, tọọñọ ke Tifsa tutu ke Kasa, anyʌñ atie ke emem ke afịd ñkañ. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Ke ayio uwem Sọlọmọn Yuda ye Isrel, tọọñọ ke Daan tutu ke Beeseba, emaedʌñọ ke ifuuro, afịd awo ke idak fain amọ ye ke idak eto fik amọ.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Sọlọmọn akenie abaenañ sariọd enañmbakara tọsịn inaañ (4,000), ye enañmbakara tọsịn duob mme iba (12,000).<verse eid="1KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Mme adaaha, anie afiọñ amọ anie, ekesinọ ndidia ye ñkpọufọk Adidem Sọlọmọn ye afịd awo se idia ke akpokoro adidem. Ammọ emaekịt ebo ke ñkpọ ndomokeed inanake. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Ammọ ñko emaenyʌñ edat udomo baali ye ñnyanyaha enọ mme sariọd enañmbakara ye mme enañmbakara mbon ñko.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aniọñ Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Abasi amaanọ Sọlọmọn aniọñ ye ataa ekamba ikike, ye ubom ifiọk awo imiikanna iben idomo ye ntan ke mben akpa. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Aniọñ Sọlọmọn amaakpon akan aniọñ afịd mbon Usakkautịn, anyʌñ akpon akan afịd aniọñ mbon Iyib. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Anye amaadiọọñọ ñkpọ akan afịd awo mfen, akan Etan awo Esra, adiọọñọ ñkpọ akan Heman, Kalkol ye Daada, nditọ ideen Mahol. Ndin etob amọ amaasuana ke mme ñkanñkʌk idịd. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Anye amaatop ñke tọsịn ita ndin mme ikwọ amọ akedo tọsịn keed ye ikie ition. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Anye amaatañ ikọ abaña uwem eto ye mbid, tọọñọ ke sida Lebanọn tutu awuọ haisọb a-atịppeke awuọ ke mme ndibene. Anye amaanyʌñ atañ abaña mme unam ye mme inuen, mme unam se inyọnyọọn ye mme iyak. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Mme awo emaeto afịd idịd, ake mme adidem afịd ekondo ekekoppo etob aniọñ Sọlọmọn ekedọññọ, ete edi edikpañ utọñ ekop aniọñ Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mbeeñeidem Adibọp Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">5: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Ke ikpañwed Hibru 1 Nd 5:1-18 ewet 1 Nd 5:15-32</char>
    </note> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Idaha Hiram, adidem Tai akekoppo ke emaeyet Sọlọmọn adan nte adidem Isrel adidat itie ete amọ Defid, anye amaadọñ mme isʌñutom amọ yak ebịne Sọlọmọn, sia anye akesʌk asiba ufan-ufan ye Defid. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Sọlọmọn amaanọ etob esọk Hiram:<verse eid="1KI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Afo amediọọñọ ke sia ekọñ akenwanake ye ete mmi Defid ato afịd itie, anye ikikanna ibọp tembịd inọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ tutu <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> asịn mme asua amọ ke idak ukod amọ. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Ado idahami, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi annọ miin emem añkanna akʌk, ndin asua me ñkpọntịppe ibaaha. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Ke ntoro, ami mmeduak adibọp tembịd nnọọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo ete mmi Defid, idaha a-anye akebooho, ‘Ayịn mfo awodeen ake ami ndiitem ke ebekpo ke itie mfo ayaabọp tembịd anọ Anyịñ mmi.’<verse eid="1KI 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />“Ke ntoro nọ adudu nọ ekpok mme sida Lebanọn ennọ miin. Ikọd mmi eyaenam utom ye ikọd mfo, ndin ami ñyaukpe fiin ye mbon utom mfo ekọmudua akʌk se afo asiak. Afo amediọọñọ ke ñnyịn inieghe mbon e-enieghe ifiọk ukpịkke eto nte mbon Sidọn.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Ke Hiram akekoppo etob Sọlọmọn, esịd amaanem anye eti-eti ndin anye amaabo, “Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke usen mfịn, sia anye anọ Defid ayịn aniọñ adikaara ekamba idịd ami.”<verse eid="1KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Ndin Hiram anọ etob ami asọk Sọlọmọn:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 5:8">“Ami mmebọ etob ake afo anọọhọ ensọk ndin ñyaanam se afo ayem ke edinọ mme mbio eto sida ye eto yunipa. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Ideen mmi eyaetuut ammọ eto Lebanọn ekaa ekewuọ Akpa Mediterenia, ndin ami ñyaafiọọrọ ammọ nte ubom ke akpa akewuọ itie ake afo ayemme ebono. Ke ndo ñyaabakka ammọ ndin afo ayaakoono asio. Ndin afo ayaanam ebeeñe mmi ke edinọ mbon ufọk mmi ndidia.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Ke ntom Hiram amaanọ Sọlọmọn afịd mbio eto sida ye eto yunipa se anye akeyem, <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />ndin Sọlọmọn amaanọ Hiram udomo kọọ wiid tọsịn edịb (20,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 3,600 me metrịk tọọn 3,250</char></note> nte ndidia anọ ufọk amọ, amaana adian abañ unyenyịmme adan ọlif tọsịn edịb (20,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte lita 440,000</char></note>. Sọlọmọn amaakaa iso adinam ami nnọọ Hiram kwa isua kwa isua. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ Sọlọmọn aniọñ, kpa naña anye akenwọñọ anọ anye. Emem amaaba ke ufọọd Hiram ye Sọlọmọn, ndin ammọ awo iba emaedʌk edioomo.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaakoono mbon utom ke afịd Isrel, ideen tọsịn edịb mme duob (30,000). <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Anye amaanọ ammọ eka Lebanọn ke ikpeghe tọsịn duob (10,000) ke afiọñ, ammọ emaeba afiọñ keed ke Lebanọn ye afiọñ iba ke idʌñ. Adọniram akedo etubom mbon unyenyịk utom ado. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Sọlọmọn amaanie mbon ubiomñkpọ tọsịn ata mme duob ye mme asiakitiad tọsịn anaañ ke mme abod, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />adian ye mme adaaha utom Sọlọmọn ikie edịb mme duob mme ita (3,300) e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña utom ye mme anamutom. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Ke ewʌhọ adidem ammọ emaesioño ataa nti ikpọ itiad nọ ekama esịn itiad idakisọñ anọ udọdiọñ itiad ke tembịd. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Mbon utom Sọlọmọn ye Hiram ye mbon utom e-eketooho Baiblos emaediọñ eto ye itiad se ekama ebọp itieukpono.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Sọlọmọn Abọp Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua ikie inaañ mme anaañ (480) ke nditọ Isrel emaekekpọñ Iyib, ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara Sọlọmọn ke Isrel, ke afiọñ Sif, ayọhọ afiọñ iba, anye amaatọọñọ adibọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="1KI 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Tembịd ake Adidem Sọlọmọn akebọppọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenyọọñ kubid ata, atara ukpa ke kubid edịb anyʌñ akoñ ke kubid edịb mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 90, ikpad 30 ke ukpa ye ikpad 45 ke ukoñ me mita 27 ke unyọọñ, mita 9 ke ukpa ye mita 14 ke ukoñ </char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Ntondʌk ke iso akpan akwere tembịd amaatat ubom tembịd, a-adooho kubid edịb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 30 me mita 9; se ñko ke 1 Nd 6:16 ye 20</char></note>, anyʌñ asio kubid duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 15 me mita 4,5; se ñko ke 1 Nd 6:23-26</char></note> ke iso tembịd. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Anye amaanam mfafaha ubenafịm ke anyọñ ndibene tembịd. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Ke ndibene akpan akwere ye ke esịdubeed, anye amaabọp ufọkanyọñ akanna tembịd akʌk, akenyʌñ anie mme ndian-ndian ubeed. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Nsuuhoñkan ufọkisọñ akenie ubom kubid ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me mita 4.5; se ñko ke 1 Nd 6:10</char></note>, ufọọd anyọñ ado kubid itiokeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 9 me ñkpọ nte mita 2.7</char></note> ndin ayọhọ anyọñ ita ado kubid itiaba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 11 me mita 3.2</char></note>. Anye amaanam mbood awuọhọ atịgha akanna anwa itieukpono mbaak edifaak ñkpọ ndomokeed ke ndibene tembịd.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Ke edibọp tembịd ami, ukweeñe itiad se ekekama akedo anye e-emaekediọñ ema ke itie udiọñ itiad, ndin awo ikikoppo uyom ukọññkpọ me ñkpọ ukabñkpọ me ñkpọutom ukwak ndomokeed ke ini esʌkkọ ebọp tembịd ado.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Ntondʌk a-akaaha nsuuho ñkan isọñufọk akedo ke usuuk mbeñ ukañ tembịd; udodukod amaaben akewuọ asịne ufọọd anyọñ anyʌñ ato do akewuọ ayọhọ anyọñ ita. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Ndin anye amaabọp tembịd anyʌñ akweeñe anye, akama mboi ye adukpọk sida akọọñ akọm. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Ndin anye amaabọp mme ndian-ndian ubeed akanna tembịd. Unyọọñ keed akedo kubid ition, enyʌñ ekama mboi sida edian ammọ ke tembịd.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadiwuọ Sọlọmọn idem: <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Amaado tembịd ake afo asʌkkọ abọp mi, adieke afo akeeneke mme ewʌhọ mmi, anam mme mbed mmi anyʌñ anịm mme item mmi anyʌñ akop item, ami ñyaanam enwọñọ añkenamma nnọ ete mfo Defid uto fiin adisu. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Ndin ami ñyaadʌñ ke atu mbon Isrel ndiinyʌññọ ñkpọñ mbon mmi Isrel.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaabọp tembịd anyʌñ akweeñe anye. <verse eid="1KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Anye akekama adukpọk eto sida abana esịd ndibene, adian tọọñọ ke isọñ tembịd tutu anyọñ, ndin akekama adukpọk yunipa afʌk isọñ tembịd. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Anye amaakama adukpọk sida abakka kubid edịb asio ke edem tembịd tọọñọ ke anyọñ tutu awuọ isọñ nọ akappa ado ataa esịdubeed, ataa Adisana Itie. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Akpan akwere ke iso esịdubeed ami akenyọọñ kubid aba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 60 me mita 18</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Esịd tembịd akedo sida, emaekap ke mme ikịm ye ñkpokpoñ a-atarake. Afịd ñkpọ akedo sida; awo ikikịtte itiad ndomokeed.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Anye amaadiọñ ata esịdubeed ke esịd tembịd ediben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> nnịm ke ndo. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Esịdubeed ado akenyọọñ kubid edịb, ubom akedo edịb anyʌñ akoñ ke kubid edịb. Anye akefʌk esịd amọ ye ataa kold, anyʌñ afʌk akpokoro uwa ye sida. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Sọlọmọn amaafʌk esịd tembịd ye ataa kold, anyʌñ aneeñe ñkpọnọ kold ke afịd iso itieuwa, e-ekefʌkkọ ke kold. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Ndin anye amaafʌk afịd esịd ado ye kold. Anye amaanyʌñ afʌk akpokoro uwa ake esịdubeed ye kold.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Ke esịdubeed ado anye amaanam serubim iba ato ke eto ọlif, keedekeed akoñ ke kubid duob. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Mba akpa serub akenyọọñ ke kubid ition, mba anye ako ado kubid ition, kubid duob tọọñọ ke utịd mba keed tutu akesịm utịd mba anye ako. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Ayọhọ serub iba akenyʌñ adomo kubid duob, sia naña serub iba ekedoñño ukem ke idaha ye utọ. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Unyọọñ serub keed akedo kubid duob. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Anye amaadot serubim ado ke ataa esịdubeed tembịd, mba ammọ atatara. Mba serub keed amaatuuk ndibene, mba anye ako atuuk ndibene uko, ndin mba ammọ emaetuuk emọ-emọ ke ufọọd ubeed ado. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Anye amaafʌk serubim ye kold.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Ke mme ndibene e-ekannake tembịd, ke mme ubeed esịd ye ake anwa, anye amaakap serubim, mme eto ayob ye mme ñkpokpoñ e-etaraketara. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Anye amaanyʌñ afʌk isọñ mme ubeed esịd ye ake anwa tembịd ye kold.<verse eid="1KI 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Anye amaakama eto ọlif anam mme udọk ntondʌk a-akaaha ataa esịd itie ukpono a-akedooho itie keed ke mbaak ition ke ubom itie ukpono. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Ndin ke mme usʌñ eto ọlif ado anye amaakap serubim, mme eto ayob ye mme ñkpokpoñ e-etaraketara, anyʌñ adat umemịñ kold afʌk ke mme serubim ye mme eto ayob ado. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Kpa ke ukem usʌñ ado, ke ntondʌk a-akaaha akpan akwere anye amaanam mme itịm e-ekamake eto ọlif enam a-akedooho itie keed ke mbakka inaañ ndibene ado. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Anye amaanyʌñ anam usʌñ iba ke eto yunipa enam, keedekeed anie mfañ iba e-ekewọññọke ke mme adudu. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Anye amaakap serubim, mme eto ayob ye mme ñkpokpoñ e-etaraketara anyʌñ afʌk ammọ ye umemịñ kold e-efʌkkọ ukem-ukem ke mme ukakab ñkpọ ado.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Ndin anye amaakama udịm udọdiọñ itiad ita ye udịm udọdiọñ itiad ye eto sida keed abọp esịd akwere ado.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Ekenam itiad idakisọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke ayọhọ isua inaañ, ke afiọñ Sif. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme keed ke afiọñ Bul, anam afiọñ itiaita, emaekweeñe adibọp tembịd ye afịd se akenaa nte enam akeene afịd udomoñkpọ. Anye akedat isua itiaba abọp anye.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Sọlọmọn Abọp Ufọkidʌñ Amọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Ado, Sọlọmọn akedat isua duob mme ita adikweeñe adibọp itieidʌñ amọ. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Anye amaabọp Ufọkadidem Akai Lebanọn unyọọñ kubid ikie, ukpa ado aba mme duob ndin akoñ edịb mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 150 ke unyọọñ, ikpad 75 ke ukpa ye ikpad 45 ke ukoñ me mita 45 ke unyọọñ, mita 23 ke ukpa ye mita 14 ke ukoñ</char></note>, anie udịm abai eto sida inaañ edat esọọñọ mme atekke e-enamma ke udọdiọñ sida. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Ekedat eto sida ekọñ akọm ke anyọñ atekke akedoroke ke mme abai atekke aba mme inaañ, duob mme ition ke udịm keed. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Ekebono mme ubenafịm amọ ke anyọñ ke ikpeghe ita, keed asak iso ase keed. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Afịd inuausʌñ ekenie mbañ inaañ, ammọ ekeba ke iso ke mme ikpeghe ita-ita, esak iso ese emọ-emọ.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Anye amaanam mme udịm adaaha akenyọọñọ ke kubid aba mme duob ndin ukpa ado edịb mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 75 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 45 ke ukpa me mita 23 ke unyọọñ ye mita 14 ke ukpa</char></note>. Ke iso akedo ntondʌk, ndin ke iso amọ akedoñño mme abai ye utetekke akọm.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Anye amaabọp afe ebekpo, Afe ukpe Unen, itie a-akenaaha anye akpe ikpe, ndin anye amaafʌk anye ke sida tọọñọ ke anyọñ tutu awuọ isọñ. <verse eid="1KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Ndin ufọk adidem a-akenaaha nte anye adʌñ, emaesịkke ekaa edem, akenyʌñ anie ukem ndaha. Sọlọmọn amaanyʌñ abọp ukem ufọk adidem nte afe ami anọ ayịn awonwaan Fero, anye akedọọhọ.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Afịd mme ufọk, tọọñọ ke anwa tutu awuọ ekamba akwere, ñko tọọñọ ke itiad idakisọñ tutu awuọ ñyeriye, ekedat ataa eti itiad ekpok ke udomo enyʌñ etʌk esịd ye edem ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Ekedat ataa nti ikpọ itiad enịm mme itiad idakisọñ, usʌk ekedomo kubid duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 15 me mita 4.5; se ñko ke 1 Nd 7:23</char></note> usʌk ado itiaita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 12 me mita 3.6</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Ke anyọñ akedo ataa nti itiad, ekpok ke udomo, ye abai sida. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Emaekanna ekamba akwere ye udịm udọdiọñ itiad ita ye udịm udọdiọñ atekke sida keed, kpa naña ekenam akwere tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ekamba ntondʌk esa amọ.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbana Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaadọñ ekaa Tai ekeben Huram, <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />e-eka amọ akedooho ebekpa ato ubon Naftali ndin ete amọ aketo Tai anyʌñ ado ata anamusọ ke akpoho. Huram amaayọhọ ye aniọñ, ye ikike ye ifiọk adinam afịd utom akpoho. Anye amaadi abịne Adidem Sọlọmọn anyʌñ anam afịd utom e-ekenọọhọ anye anam.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Anye amaabot adaaha akpoho iba, unyọọñ keed akedo kubid duob mme itiaita, ikara ado kubid duob mme iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 27 ke unyọọñ ye ikpad 18 ke ikara</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Anye amaanyʌñ abot mbuod iba adidot ke anyọñ mme adaaha ado; keedekeed akekoñ kubid ition<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 7 1/2 me mita 2.3; se ñko ke 1 Nd 7:23</char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Emaedukpakka ukwak ekama ebana mbuod anyọñ mme adaaha ado, keed anie itiaba. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Anye amaanam mme pomekrened ke udịm iba ekanna ndukpakka ukwak keed edidat mbana mbuod anyọñ mme adaaha ado. Anye amaanam ukem ado anọ adaaha keedekeed. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Ekenam mbuod anyọñ mme adaaha ke ntondʌk nte mme lili, kubid inaañ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 6 me mita 1.8; se ñko ke 1 Nd 7:38</char></note> ke ukoñ. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Ke anyọñ mbuod mme adaaha iba, ke anyọñ ñkpọ a-atieghe nte ntəño usan a-akpereke ukpakpakka ado, akedo mme pomekrened ikie iba ke udịm ekanna. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Anye amaabọp mme abai adaaha ke ntondʌk tembịd. Adaaha ake usuuk anye akekoot Yakịn ndin ake adoro anye akoot Boas. <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Mme mbuod anyọñ ekeba idem nte mme lili. Ndin utom ke mme adaaha amaakweeñe.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Anye amaadat ukwak akpoho anam Akpainyañ, anam anye ado ikara-ikara, udomo amọ akedo kubid duob tọọñọ ke mbeñ keed tutu akaa akewuọ mbeñ mfen ye kubid ition ke ukoñ. Ekedat udʌk a-adooho kubid edịb mme duob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 45 me mita 14</char></note> edidomo anye ñkanna. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Ke idak mben ado, mme ukpok ekanna anye ekʌk, duob ke kubid keed. Mme ukpok ado ekedoñño ke udịm iba ke itie keed ye Akpainyañ.<verse eid="1KI 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Akpainyañ ado akedoro ke anyọñ ñyaaraenañ duob mme iba, ita esak iso ese adoro, ita ese usobutịn, ita ese usuuk ndin ita ese usakkautịn. Akpainyañ ado adoro ke anyọñ ammọ, ndin ukod edem ammọ akewọt ufọọd. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Anye akedo ekpaubọk keed ke udob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte sentimita 7.5</char></note>, mben amọ aketie nte mben kọọb, nte lili atara. Anye akedọñọ abañ mmọọñ tọsịn iba (2,000)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte lita 44,000; Septuakin inieghe udịmikọ ami.</char></note>.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Anye amaanyʌñ adat akpoho anam udodñkpọ duob ekemekke edidịppe; keed akedo kubid inaañ ke unyọọñ, inaañ ke ukpa ndin ita ke ukoñ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 6 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa ndin ikpad 4 1/2 ke ukoñ me ñkpọ nte mita 1.8 ke unyọọñ ye ke ukpa ndin mita1.4 ke ukoñ </char></note>. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Naña ekenam mme adaaha amọ ado ami: Ammọ emaenie mbañ ekebenne edian ke mme nnennda. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Ke mme mbañ ami ke ufañ mme nnennda ekedo mme ekpe, mme enañ ye mme serubim ndin ye ke mme nnennda ñko. Ke anyọñ ye ke idak mme ekpe ye ñyaaraenañ ekedoñño mme ikara ñyeriye. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Nnennda keed akenie uwereñkpọ akpoho inaañ ye ubọk akpoho, ndin keed akenie besịn a-adoroke ke afara inaañ, ebono ñyeriye ke ñkañ keedekeed. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Ke esịd udodñkpọ adudu amaaba a-akenieghe ekara abọbọọk a-aketʌñọke ke kubid keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte sentimita 45</char></note>. Adudu ami akedo ikara-ikara, ndin adaaha idakisọñ amọ akedomo kubid keed mme ubaak<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte ikpad 2 1/4 me sentimita 68; se ñko ke 1 Nd 7:32</char></note>. Ke adudu ami emaekap ñkpọ ekanna mben inua ado. Mme ñkpaha udodñkpọ akedo mbañ inaañ ukem-ukem, idoññoke ekara. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Mme uwereñkpọ inaañ ekebañña ke idak mme ñkpaha, ndin eyịt mme ubọk mme uwereñkpọ ado edian ke udodñkpọ. Tọọñọ ke iwuod keed awuọ iwuod uko akedo kubid keed mme ubaak. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Ekenam mme uwereñkpọ ami eba nte mme uwereñkpọ sariọd; mme ubọk, mme mben, ekekama ubobod ukwak enam afịd ukwak ye mme hub.<verse eid="1KI 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Udodñkpọ keed akenie afara inaañ, keed ke inuuk keed, anyanna ato udodñkpọ. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Ke anyọñ udodñkpọ akedo ekara mbed aketəñoke ubaak kubid<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte sentimita 23</char></note>. Mme afara ye mme panel ekediana ye anyọñ udodñkpọ. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Anye amaakap mme serubim, mme ekpe ye ekpad ayob ke anyọñ mme afara ye mme adukpọk, ke nte ufañ akebaba, enyʌñ edat ñyeriye ekanna ekʌk. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Ntom ke anye akenam udodñkpọ duob ado. Ekekama ukem-ukem ñkpọ ekap ndin afịd ekedoñño ata ukem-ukem ke idem ye ke ubom.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Ndin anye amaanam besịn akpoho duob, keed adọñọ abañ mmọọñ aba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte lita 880</char></note> anyʌñ adomo kubid inaañ ke unyọọñ, besịn keedekeed adoro ke mme udodñkpọ duob ado. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Anye amaabono udodñkpọ ition ke usuuk ñkañ tembịd ndin ition ke adoro. Anye amaanịm Akpainyañ ke ñkañ usuuk, ke inuuk usuuk-usuuk usakkautịn tembịd. <verse eid="1KI 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Anye amaanyʌñ anam mme ako, mme udọk mbakara ye mme usan usiimeñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:40">Ndin Huram amaakweeñe afịd ubiọñutom anye akenamma anọ Adidem Sọlọmọn ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:<verse eid="1KI 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />mme adaaha iba;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">mme mbuod iba e-ebaaha nte ntəño usan ke anyọñ mme adaaha;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">mme ukpakpakka ñkpọ iba e-edatta ebana mme mbuod iba e-ebaaha nte e-ebaaha ke anyọñ mme adaaha;<verse eid="1KI 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />mme pomekrened ikie inaañ (400) e-enieghe ukpakpakka ubonoñkpọ iba (udịm pomekrened iba ke ukpakpakka ubonoñkpọ keedekeed ebana mme mbuod iba e-ebaaha nte ntəño usan e-ebaaha ke anyọñ adaaha);<verse eid="1KI 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />mme udodñkpọ duob ye mme besịn duob ammọ;<verse eid="1KI 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />Akpainyañ ye ñyaaraenañ duob mme iba ke idak amọ;<verse eid="1KI 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />mme ako, mme udọk mbakara ye mme usan usiimeñkpọ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 7:45" />
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:45">Afịd mme ñkpoduoho ake Huram akenamma anọ Adidem Sọlọmọn nọ ebọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekedat nti utọtʌk brọns enañña. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Adidem amaanam etat ammọ ke udomoñkpọ aduañ ke unaisọñ Yọdan ke ufọọd Sukọd ye Saretan. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Sọlọmọn ikikpaaha idem adidomo afịd mme ñkpọ ami, sia emaewak ebọhọ; awo ikidiọọñọke udomo brọns.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Sọlọmọn amaanyʌñ anam afịd ñkpọ mbana ufọk a-akebaaha ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 7:48" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">akpokoro uwa ake kold;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">akpokoro kold e-ekedotto Uyo Iso Abasi;<verse eid="1KI 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />mme udodutuenikañ ake ataa eti kold (ition ke nnasia ition ñko ke ufiin, ke iso esịd itieukpono);</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:49">udodom ñkpọ kold ye mme utuenikañ ye ufadikañ;<verse eid="1KI 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />mme besịn ataa kold, ufad afọñikañ, mme usan usiimeñkpọ, mme usan ndidia ye mme usan insensi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:50">ye mme afara kold edikama mfak mme usʌñ ataa esịd ubeed, Ata Adisana Itie, ñko ye mme usʌñ akpan afe ake tembịd.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Ke afịd utom se Adidem Sọlọmọn akenam ke tembịd amaakekweeñe, anye amaakoono mme ñkpoduoho se ete amọ Defid akenịm asaña-asaña adidọñ, mme ñkpọ mbana ake silfa ye ake kold, ndin anye amaabono ammọ ke ekpurikpu ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eben Akebe Edioomo edi Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Ndin Adidem Sọlọmọn amaakoot mme ñkpisọñ Isrel edi ke iso amọ ke Yeruselem, afịd mme iwuod ubon ye mme ufọk, ediben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> edọọk eto Saiyọn, Abio Defid. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Afịd nditọ Isrel emaedisoobo ke esịd keed ekeene Adidem Sọlọmọn ke ini usọrọ ke afiọñ Etanim, ayọhọ afiọñ itiaba.<verse eid="1KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Ke ini afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke Isrel emaekediwuọ, mme aku emaeben akebe edioomo, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />ndin ammọ emaeben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye atayad mbono ye afịd ndisana ñkpọ mbana ufọk ke esịd amọ. Mme aku ye mme Lifai emaekoono afịd ñkpọ edọọk, <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />ndin Adidem Sọlọmọn ye afịd esob Isrel e-ekediighe edisoobo ye anye ekeba ke iso akebe edioomo, esʌk ewa uwak-uwak edọñ ye mme enañ ake awo imiikikanna adiwewet me adibabat.<verse eid="1KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Mme aku ndin emaeben akebe edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ekaa itie amọ ke ataa esịd ubeed tembịd, Ata Adisana Itie, ekenịm anye ke idak mme mba serubim. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Mme serubim emaetat mme mba ammọ ke anyọñ itie akebe edioomo emaenyʌñ efʌk akebe edioomo ye mme mboi edatta eben anye. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Mme mboi ami emaenyọọñ tutu eda ekịt utịd ammọ ke Adisana Itie ke iso ataa esịd ubeed, ado awo ikikịtte ito anwa Adisana Itie; ndin ammọ mmọdo esʌk eba tutu mfịn ami. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Ñkpọ ndomokeed ikisịneke ke akebe edioomo ikan itiadñwed iba ake Moses akesịnne ke Họreb, ke itie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenamma edioomo ye mbon Isrel ke ammọ emaekewuọñọ eto Iyib.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Ke ini mme aku emaekekpọñ Adisana Itie, ntọñanyọñ amaafʌk tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Ndin mme aku ikikanna adinam utom ammọ ke ntak ntọñanyọñ, sia ubọọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayọhọ tembịd amọ.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ke imọ idiidʌñ ke ñkịm-ñkịm ntọñanyọñ; <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />Ke akpanikọ ami mmebọp ñwuọnda uyaiya tembịd unọ fiin, itie se afo adʌñ ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Ke ini afịd esob Isrel ekesʌkkọ eda do, adidem amaawọññọ anyʌñ adiọñ ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Ndin anye amaabo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:15">“Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, a-adooho anye adat ubọk amọ anam se anye akedat inua amọ anwọñọ anọ ete mmi Defid. Sia anye amaabo, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Tọọñọ ke usen a-ami ñkebenne ikọd mmi Isrel nsio ke Iyib, ami mmekke abio ke esiin Isrel ndomokeed nọ ebọp tembịd ma Anyịñ mmi aba ke ndo, ado ami mmemek Defid adikaara ikọd mmi Isrel.’<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />“Ete mmi Defid amaakere ke esịd amọ adibọp tembịd nnọọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo ete mmi Defid, ‘Afo amaanam eti-eti adikere ke esịd mfo adibọp tembịd nnọọ Anyịñ mmi. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Kpayeado, idooho afo uduudo andibọb tembịd ado, ado ayịn mfo, abʌk ye iyiib mfo, anye adiido andidiibọp tembịd inọ Anyịñ mmi.’<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anịm enwọñọ ake anye akenamma: ami mmedat itie Defid ete mmi ndin idahami ami ntie ke ebekpo Isrel, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenwọñọ, ndin ami mmebọp tembịd ado nnọ Anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Ami mmenam itie ke ndo nnọ akebe edioomo, a-asịneke edioomo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-anye akenamma ye mme eteete ñnyịn idaha anye akesioho ammọ ke Iyib.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akam Adidiọñ Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaada ke iso mbid kold akpokoro ekedotto Uyo Iso Abasi; <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke iso afịd esob Isrel, atat ubọk amọ awọt anyọñ <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />ndin amaabo:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:23">“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ibaaha Abasi mfen a-abaaha nte afo ke hefịn ke anyọñ me ke idak isọñ; afo ake anịmme edioomo ima mfo ye mme ikọd mfo ake esʌkkọ esaña ke afịdesịd ke usʌñ mfo. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Afo amenịm enwọñọ mfo anọ awo mfo Defid ete mmi; afo amenwọñọ ke inua mfo ndin ke ubọk mfo amenam anye asu, kpa naña anye ado mfịn ami.<verse eid="1KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />“Idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, nịm nọ afʌnadeen mfo Defid ete mmi mme enwọñọ a-afo akenamma anọọ anye idaha afo akebooho, ‘Afo uduutreke adinie adiaakpa se idiitie ke iso mmi ke ebekpo Isrel, akpekapado ubon mfo eyaekpeme ke afịd se ammọ enam ke edisaña ke iso mmi nnam akpanikọ kpa naña afo anam.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Ndin idahami, Abasi Isrel, yak ikọ afo akenwọñọke anọọ afʌnadeen mfo Defid ete mmi asu ke akpanikọ.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Ado me Abasi ayaasʌk adʌñ ke ederimbod? Mme anyọñ, kpa ataa anyọñ akoñño akan, ikanna ukem fiin. Nwaanwa dise tembịd ake ami mbọppọ! <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Sʌk kpañ utọñ kop akam afʌnadeen mfo ye ñkpeubọk nyʌñ tua mbọm, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi. Kop aseeme ye akam ake afʌnadeen mfo abọññọ ke iso mfo ke usen mfịn. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Yak anyen mfo atara ase tembịd ami akonayio ye uweemeayio, itie ami a-afo akebooho, ‘Anyịñ Mmi ayaaba ke ndo,’ nọ afo uduukop akam ake afʌnadeen mfo abọññọ ke itie ami. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Kop akam ñkpeubọk afʌnadeen mfo ye ake ikọd mfo Isrel ke ini ammọ ebọññọ akam ese itie ami. Kop ke anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo, ndin umaukop, feen.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Awo ndomokeed amaadue mbọhọidʌñ amọ ndin ado ke ana anye ata unwọñọ ndin ammọ edi mi enyʌñ enwọñọ unwọñọ ado ke iso akpokoro uwa mfo ke tembịd ami, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />ndin tie ke hefịn kop nyʌñ tịppe ñkpọ nam. Biere ikpe ke ufọọd ikọd mfo, sua nọ andidue ke adisuuk se ammọ ekenam ndoot ammọ ke iwuod, ye ke adisaana mbon unana ndudue ñyaak nyʌñ nam ye ammọ nọ asaña akekem ke unana ndudue ammọ.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Ke ini asua akanna mbon mfo Isrel sia ammọ udue fiin, ndin ke ini ammọ etịmmeke edem edi enyʌñ enọ anyịñ mfo itooro, ebọñ akam enyʌñ enam ñkpeubọk unọ fiin ke tembịd ami, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />ndin kop ke anyọñ nyʌñ feen ndudue ikọd mfo Isrel ndin ben ammọ tịmme nyọñ di ke isọñ ake afo akenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Ke ini emaekʌk mme enyọñ ndin edịm ideppe sia mbon mfo udue fiin, ndin ammọ ebọñ akam ese itie ami enyʌñ enọ anyịñ mfo itooro enyʌñ etịmme edem ekpọñ ndudue ammọ sia afo amemia ammọ ufen, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />ndin tie ke anyọñ kop nyʌñ feen ndudue ikọd mfo, mbon mfo Isrel. Kpeep ammọ adisaña ke nnen-nnen usʌñ, nyʌñ nam edịm adep ke isọñ ake afo akenọọhọ mbon mfo ke udeeme.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Adieke akañ me udọñọ nsobo adʌkkọ isọñ, me ikañekpo me mfuud, me mme ñkukuñkpọyọriyọ me mme ataktak, me idaha asua akannake abio ammọ ndomokeed akʌk, se utọ nsobo me udọñọ akpededi, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />ndin ke ini awo ndomokeed ke atu mbon mfo Isrel abọññọ akam me anamma ñkpeubọk, ke ekịtte ukuud esịd ammọ, enyʌñ etat ubọk enyan ke tembịd ami, <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />nyʌñ kop to anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo. Feen nyʌñ nam; nam ye afịd awo akeene afịd se ammọ enam, sia afo amediọọñọ esịd ammọ (sia afo ikpọọñ adiọọñọ esịd afịd awo), <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />nọ ato do ammọ uteeñe fiin ke afịd ini se ammọ edʌñ ke isọn ake afo akenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Amaado asenawo ake imiitooho ubon mfo Isrel ado ato anyan idịd adi ke ntak anyịñ mfo, <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />sia ammọ eyaekop etob ekamba anyịñ mfo ye akpọsọñ ubọk mfo ye adibenne ubọk mfo, ammọ emaedi edibọñ akam ese tembịd ami, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />nyʌñ kop to anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo. Nam se adodo ake asenawo ado ubeeñeke fiin, nọ afịd awo ke ekondo ediọọñọ anyịñ mfo enyʌñ uteeñe fiin, kpa naña mbon mfo Isrel enam, enyʌñ ediọọñọ ke ufọk ake ami mbọppọ mi akere Anyịñ mfo.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Ke ini mbon mfo ekaaha ekọñ ye mme asua ammọ, itie akeedodo ake afo adọññọ ammọ, ndin ammọ emaebọñ akam enọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ese abio ake afo amekke ye tembịd ake ami mbọppọ nnọ Anyịñ mfo, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />ndin tie ke anyọñ kop akam ye ñkpeubọk ammọ, nyʌñ nọ ammọ se ido unen ammọ.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Ammọ emaudue fiin, sia ibaaha awo ndomokeed ammiinamma idiọọkñkpọ, ndin afo ayat esịd ye ammọ anyʌñ ayaak ammọ anọ mme asua ammọ, e-ekekoonoke ammọ ekaa ke isọñ ammọ, a-anyọọñọ usʌñ me a-akpereke; <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />ndin adieke ammọ ekappake esịd ke isọñ e-emʌmmọ ammọ ukad, enyʌñ ekappa esịd enyʌñ ukpe fiin ubọk ke isọñ e-eketañña ammọ enyọñ enyʌñ ebo, ‘Ñnyịn iminam idiọọkñkpọ, ñnyịn iminam ndudue iminyʌñ inam se idiọọk’; <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />ndin adieke ammọ etịmmeke edem ubịne fiin ke afịd esịd ye ukpọñ ammọ ke isọñ mme asua ammọ e-eketañña ammọ eka, enyʌñ ebọñ akam ese isọñ a-afo akenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ, ese abio a-afo akemekke enyʌñ ese tembịd a-ami mbọppọ nnọ Anyịñ mfo; <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />ndin tie ke anyọñ, itieidʌñ mfo, kop akam ye ñkpeubọk ammọ, nyʌñ toppo ammọ ikpe. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Nyʌñ feen nọ mbon mfo, ake udueghe fiin; feen afịd ndudue ake ammọ udueghe fiin, nyʌñ nam mbon e-esịnne ammọ ukad etua ammọ mbọm; <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />sia ammọ edo mbon mfo ye udeeme mfo, a-afo akesioho ke Iyib, asio ke ufiob edemeikañ atadukwak.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“Yak anyen mfo akịt ñkpeubọk afʌnadeen mfo ye ñkpeubọk mbon mfo Isrel, nyʌñ kpañ utọñ nọ ammọ ini akeedodo ammọ etuaha ukoot fiin. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Sia afo amaamek ammọ asio ke atu mme idịd ekondo edido udeeme mfo, kpa naña afo aketañ ato afʌnadeen mfo Moses idaha afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikara, akesioho mme ete ñnyịn ke Iyib.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Ke ini Sọlọmọn amaakebọñ afịd mme akam ami inyʌñ inam ñkpeubọk inọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaadakka ada ke itie ake anye aketọọñọke edọñ atat ubọk amọ ase hefịn. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Anye amaadakka ada anyʌñ adiọñ afịd mbono Isrel ke akpọsọñ uyio, ate:<verse eid="1KI 8:55" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Itooro anie, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ake anọọhọ mbon amọ Isrel emem kpa naña anye akenwọñọ. Ikọ amọ ndomokeed ikpuuho ke atu afịd mme nti enwọñọ ake anye akenọọhọ ato afʌnadeen amọ Moses. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />Yak <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn aba ye ñnyịn kpa naña anye akeba ye mme ete ñnyịn; yak anye akuukpọñ akuunyʌñ afre anyen ibaña ñnyịn. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Yak anye awọññọ esịd ñnyịn akeene anye, ke edisaña ke ñkobitem nnọọ anye ñnyʌñ nam mme item amọ, mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed ake anye akenọọhọ mme ete ñnyịn. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Ndin yak mme ikọ mmi ami, a-ami mbọññọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akpere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn uweemeayio ye akonayio, nọ anye atoppo ikpe afʌnadeen ye ake mbon amọ Isrel akeene se eyem ke usen ke usen, <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />nọ afịd awo ke ekondo ediọọñọ ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado Abasi ndin ke mfen ndomokeed ibaaha. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Ndin yak esịd ndufo akeene <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ayọhọ-ayọhọ, edidu uwem ñkeene mme ewʌhọ ñnyʌñ nnam mme item amọ, ke ini ami.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidiọñ Tembịd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Akem adidem ye afịd Isrel emaediana ye anye enam uwa ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Sọlọmọn amaawa uwa ewuana mfọn anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: enañ tọsịn edịb mme iba (22,000) ye mme edọñ ye mme ebod tọsịn ikie mme edịb (120,000). Ndin adidem ye afịd Isrel emaediọñ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="1KI 8:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Kpa ke usen ado adidem amaadiọñ ufọọd akwere adaaha ke iso tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke ndo anye amaanam ufọfọb uwa, uwa ñkpasi ye uwa akpọñ unam, sia akpokoro uwa brọns a-akedaaha ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịp abọhọ adikan ndọñọ mme ufọfọb uwa, mme uwa ñkpasi ye mme akpọñ unam a-atooho mme uwa ewuana.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Ntoro ke Sọlọmọn akenam usọrọ ke ini ado, ndin afịd Isrel ye anye, ataa ekamba esob, mme awo emaeto ke Lebo Hamad tutu asịm ke Wadi ke Iyib edi. Ammọ emaedaara ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ñnyịn ke usen itiaba dian usen itiaba mfen, afịd akedo usen duob mme inaañ. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Ke edemusen anye amaanam mme atu awo enyọñọ. Ammọ emaediọñ adidem ndin enyọñọ ufọk, ke inemesịd ye idaara ke esịd ke afịd nti ñkpọ se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenam anọ afʌnadeen amọ Defid ye ikọd amọ Isrel.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Abasi Awọt Sọlọmọn Idem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Ke Sọlọmọn amaakekweeñe adibọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ufọkadidem, ke amaakenyʌñ anam afịd se anye akeduak adinam, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayaara idem awọt Sọlọmọn ayọhọ akañ iba, kpa naña anye akeyaara idem anọ anye ke Kibiọn. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" /><char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 9:3">“Ami mmekop akam ye ñkpeubọk ake afo anịmme ke iso mmi; ami mmediọñ tembịd ami, ake afo abọppọ, ke adinịm Anyịñ mmi ke ndo ke nsi-nsi. Anyen mmi ye esịd mmi ediiba do afịd-afịd ini.<verse eid="1KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />“Amaado afo, adieke afo asañake ke iso mmi ke akpanikọ ke eti esịd ye adinenido, naña Defid ete mfo akenam, anyʌñ anam afịd item se unọọ anyʌñ anam mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed mmi, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />ami ñyaanam ebekpo ubọọñ mfo asọọñọ ada ke nsi-nsi, kpa naña ñkenwọñọ nnọ Defid ete mfo idaha añkebooho, ‘Afo uduunanake awo se idiitie ke ebekpo Isrel.’<verse eid="1KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />“Ado adieke afo me ubon mfo ewọññọke eñkpọñ miin inyʌññọ inam mme item ye mme ewʌhọ ake ami unọọhọ fiin ndin ekaa ekenam ñkpọ enọ mme abasi mfen enyʌñ ekekpono ammọ, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />ndin ami ñyaakpịkke Isrel nsio ke isọñ ami nnọọhọ ammọ ñnyʌñ nsịn tembịd ami ake ami ndiọññọ nnọ Anyịñ mmi asaña-asaña. Isrel ayaakappa ado ufiid ye ñkpọ ndọk ke atu mme awo. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Itieukpono ami ayaakappa ado itoon mbio. Afịd awo se iboiyo eyaenọ ñnyọọ enyʌñ ebo, ‘Nsoo ido nọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anam utọ ñkpọ ami ke idịd ami ye ke tembịd ami?’ <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Mbon awo eyaebọọrọ, ‘Sia ammọ ewọññọ ekpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi ammọ, a-akesioho mme ete ammọ ato Iyib, ndin ekanna efat mme abasi mfen, ekpono enyʌñ enam ñkpọ enọ ammọ, ntak ado anam <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anọ ammọ afịd ukuud ami.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Utom Sọlọmọn Mfen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Ke utịd isua edịb, ini ake Sọlọmọn akedatta abọp mme ufọk iba ami: tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ufọk ubọọñ adidem, <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanọ Hiram adidem Tai abio edịb ke Kalili, sia Hiram akenọọ anye afịd sida ye yunipa ye kold se anye akeyem. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Ado Hiram aketo Tai akese mme abio Sọlọmọn akenọọhọ anye, anye ikikoppo inemesịd ibaña ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Anye amaabịp abo, “Nsoo utọ mme abio idoñño ami ke afo annọ miin, ayịneka?” Ndin anye amaakoot mme abio ado Isọñ Kabul, anyịñ ammọ ekereke tutu usen mfịn. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Ndin Hiram amaanọ talen kold ikie mme edịb (120)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 4 1/2 me metrịk tọọn 4</char></note> esọk adidem.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />Anyem ado etob a-abañake utom ufiik ake Adidem Sọlọmọn akenyịkke mme awo nọ ebọp tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ufọk ubọọñ amọ, mme ntondʌk esa, ndibene Yeruselem, ye ake Hasọ, Mekido ye Kesa. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />(Fero adidem Iyib amaanwana anyʌñ adat abio Kesa. Anye amaakịm ikañ asịn do. Anye amaawot mbon Kenan ekedʌñọke do ndin amaaben anọ nte enọ ñkpọ ndọ ayịn awonwaan amọ, anwaan Sọlọmọn. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaamaana abọp Kesa.) Anye amaabọp Usuuk Bed Họrọn, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />Baalad, ye Tadmọọ ke akpautatan, ke isọñ amọ, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />kpa ye afịd mme abio ubonoñkpọ ye mme abio ake mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara Sọlọmọn, se anye akpekeyeyem adibọp ke Yeruselem, ke Lebanọn ye ke afịd itie se anye akekara.<verse eid="1KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Akesʌk ababa mbon awo ekesʌhọke ke atu mbon Amọọ, mbon Hed, mbon Peris, mbon Hif, ye mbon Yebus (mbon ami ikidoññoke mbon Isrel). <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />Sọlọmọn amaanyịk anyʌñ akoono afịd mbon ubon idịd ami se ikisʌhọ ke isọñ ake mbon Isrel imiikikanna isobo ima, nọ ammọ enam utom enọ ammọ nte ifʌn mbon utom, kpa naña asʌk aba tutu adiwuọ mfịn. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Ado Sọlọmọn ikidatta ifʌn ito mbon Isrel; ammọ ekedoñño mme anwana ekọñ, mme anam utom abio, mme adaiwuod, mme etubom ekọñ ye mme adaiso mme sariọd ye mme andiwad mme sariọd. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Ammọ ñko ekedoñño mme adaaha e-ekeseeghe ñkpọ ebaña mme utom Sọlọmọn, mme adaaha ikie ition mme aba mme duob (550) ekesise ñkpọ ebaña mbon e-ekenamma utom ado.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Ke ayịn awonwaan Fero amaaketo Abio Defid adi ufọkadidem Sọlọmọn akebọppọ anọ anye akpọ-akpọ, Sọlọmọn amaadibọp mme ntondʌk esa.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Sọlọmọn akesiwa ufọfọb uwa ye uwa ewuana ke akpokoro uwa a-anye akebọppọ anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akañ ita ke isua, afọp insensi ye ammọ ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ke ntoro anye amaanam se akpena nte anye anam nte ubiọñutom ke tembịd.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanyʌñ abọp mme ubom ke Esiọn Keba, a-akpereke Elad ke Edọm, ke esʌk Ndad-Ndad Inyañ. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Ndin Hiram amaadọñ ikọd amọ, mme awadinyañ e-ekediọọñọke akpainyañ, ekekeene ewat inyañ ye mbon Sọlọmọn. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Ammọ emaewat ekewuọ Ọfia enyʌñ edat talen kold ikie inaañ mme edịb (420)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 16 me metrịk tọọn 14</char></note> enyọñ edi, ediyaak enọ Adidem Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Abọọñanwaan Seba Adise Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Ke idaha akwa abọọñanwaan Seba akekoppo etob abaña Sọlọmọn ye ewuana amọ ye <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, anye amaadi adidomo Sọlọmọn nse ye ñkpọsọñ mbuume. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Ke anye adiwuọhọ Yeruselem ye ataa uwak udịm mbonisañ ye mme kamel ebiommo mme anemufịk mfiọññọ, uwak ibad kold, ye mme nsọñudua itiad; anye amaadi abịne Sọlọmọn amaanyʌñ adineme nsio-nsio ñkpọ se ikisịne anye ke esịd. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Sọlọmọn amaabọọrọ afịd mbuume amọ; ibaaha ñkpọ se ikisọñ ikan adidem adineeñe ñwọt anye. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Ke ini akwa abọọñanwaan Seba akekịtte afịd aniọñ Sọlọmọn ye ufọkadidem a-anye akebọppọ, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />ndidia ke akpokoro amọ, naña mme adaaha amọ etie, nditọufọk ye mme nsiine ammọ, mbon ukama mmịn ye mme nsiine ammọ ye mme ufọfọb uwa a-anye akenamma ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, idem amaakpa anye ataa eti-eti.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Anye amaabo adidem, “Etob ake ami ñkekoppo ke idịd mmi mbaña mme utom mfo ye aniọñ mfo ado akpanikọ. <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Ado ami ñkenịmme mme ñkpọ ami tutu ndi ndikịt ke anyen mmi. Ke akpanikọ, iwuọhọwuọ mbakka keed ke itie iba se eketañ ennọọ ubaña fiin; ke aniọñ ye ke inie, afo amenekke akan etob ake ami ñkekoppo. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Ana ado mbon mfo e-enekke ekop ataa inemesịd! Mme adaaha mfo, e-edaaha ke iso mfo afịd ini enyʌñ ekop aniọñ mfo, e-ekop ataa inemesịd! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Itooro anie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo, a-anemme esịd ye afo anyʌñ unịm fiin ke ebekpo Isrel. Ke ntak nsi-nsi ima <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anieghe anọ Isrel, anye unam fiin adidem anọ ammọ, nọ afo anam unen ye nnekke-nnekke ido esọọñọ eda.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Akem anye amaanọ adidem talen kold ikie mme edịb (120), akpọmiọk mfiọññọ, ye mme nsọñudua itiad. Ikibaaha aba naña ekemaana eben utọ akpọmiọk anemufịk mfiọññọ ake akwa abọọñanwaan Seba akenọọhọ Adidem Sọlọmọn edʌk edi.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />(Mme ubom Hiram emaedat kold eto Ọfia edi; ammọ emaeto ke udo eben mme ikpọ mbiomo eto almuk ye mme nsọñudua itiad. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Adidem amaadat eto almuk abọp mme nnennda anọ tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ke ufọkadidem, anyʌñ adat anam mme ekpa ye mme ndidoudʌk anọ mbon ikwọ. Kpaanaanam awo itoboke inyʌññọ ikekịt eto almuk se iwak ntoro tọọñọ ke usen ado.)<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanọ akwa abọọñanwaan Seba afịd udọñ amọ ye se anye akebeeñe, ke asioho se anye akenọọ anye ato ubeed ubọọñ amọ afep. Ndin anye amaatịmme anyọñ idịd amọ ye udịm mbon amọ.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmọnyọ Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Udob kold se Sọlọmọn akebọọ kwa isua akedo talen ikie itiokeed mme ata mme itiokeed (666)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte tọọn 25 me metrịk tọọn 23</char></note>, <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />isịneke akʌk se anye abọ ato mme mbon mbịn ye mme anyamudua ye se ikito afịd mme ndidem mbon Arab ye mme adaukara ke mme idịd.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaanam ikpọ atuekọñ ikie iba ekedatta umemịñ kold enam; ekekama sekel kold ikie itiokeed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 6.9; se ñko ke 1 Nd 10:29</char></note> enam atuekọñ keed. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Anye amaanyʌñ anam ntək-ntək atuekọñ ikie ita kpa ke umemịñ kold, ekekama mina kold ita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.7; akpedo mina ima ke keed anye ado ñkpọ nte kilokram 3.5 </char></note> enam atuekọñ keed. Adidem amaabono ammọ ke Ufọkadidem ake Akai Lebanọn.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Ndin adidem amaadat nnʌkeniin anam ekamba ebekpo anyʌñ adat ataa eti kold afʌk anye. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Ebekpo akenie nsaña ndọọk itiokeed, ndin edem ado akenie ikara-ikara anyọñ. Mben ñkpọitie naña iba amaanie mme udodubọk, ekedaahake ekpe ke naña ñkañ iba. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Ekpe duob mme iba emaeda ke mme utọukod itiokeed ado, keed ke iwuod utọukod keedekeed. Akenaanam awo ikinamma utọ ado ke abio adidem ubọọñ ndomokeed mfen. <verse eid="1KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Afịd iko unwọññkpọ Adidem Sọlọmọn ekedoñño kold, ñko afịd mme ñkpọ ufọk ke Ufọkadidem ke Akai Lebanọn ekedoñño ataa adeghe kold. Ikibaaha ñkpọ ndomokeed se ekekama silfa enam, sia ke ayio Sọlọmọn ekedat silfa nte ñkpọ i-imiinieghe eti ekọmudua. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Adidem amaanie mme ikpọ ubom unyam udua ake Taasis ke akpainyañ ye mme ubom Hiram. Akañ keed ke isua ita ke anye akesitịmme anyọñ adi, akoono kold, silfa ye nnʌkeniin, ye mme amọnidiọk ye mme ikpọkebọk.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Adidem Sọlọmọn amaamọinyọ ke inie ye ke aniọñ akan afịd mme ndidem mfen ke ederimbod. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Afịd ekondo emaeyem ediba ke iso Sọlọmọn nọ edikop aniọñ ake Abasi akesịnne anye ke esịd. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Isua ke isua, awo ndomokeed se ikidi amaadat enọ adi, ñkpọ silfa ye kold, mme usesịne ñkpọ, mme ñkpọ ekọñ ye anemufịk ufọfiọññọ ñkpọ, mme enañmbakara ye mme ñwaahadọñki.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Sọlọmọn amaanie mme sariọd ye mme enañmbakara; anye akenie sariọd tọsịn keed mme ikie inaañ (1,400) ye enañmbakara tọsịn duob mme iba (12,000) ake anye akenyʌññọ abono ke mme abio sariọd ye adidem ke Yeruselem. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Adidem amaanam silfa awak ke Yeruselem nte ñkaña itiad, ndin eto sida emaewak nte mme eto sikamọ-fik ke mme mben abod. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Eketobo mme enañmbakara Sọlọmọn eto Iyib ye Kue; mbon unyam udua adidem ekedep ammọ eto Kue ke ekọmudua idaha ado. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Ammọ emaetobo sariọd keed eto Iyib ke ekọmudua sekel silfa ikie itiokeed (600), ye enañmbakara keed ke ikie keed mme aba mme duob (150)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 1.7</char></note>. Ammọ emaenyʌñ esịññe ammọ enọ esọk afịd ndidem mbon Hed ye ake mme Aram.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Mme Ibaan Ndọ Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Ado, Adidem Sọlọmọn amaama uwak ibaan asenidịd ke aboiyoke ayịn awonwaan Fero, mbon Mọb, mbon Amọn, mbon Edọm, mbon Sidọn ye mbon Hed. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Ammọ eketo mme idịd a-adooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo mbon Isrel, “Inaaha ndufo edudọiyọ ye ammọ, sia ammọ idiitreke ediwọññọ esịd ndufo ñkeene mme abasi ammọ.” Kpayeado, Sọlọmọn amaakpa adiana ammọ ke ima. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Anye akenie ibaan ndọ ikie itiaba (700) e-eketooho ubon ubọọñ ye ibaan esa ikie ita (300), ndin ibaan ndọ amọ emaeben anye etịn usʌñ. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Sọlọmọn aketọọñọ ikpon awo ke isua, mme ibaan amọ emaewọññọ anye esịd ekeene mme abasi mfen, ndin esịd amọ ikinekkeke ikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ aba, naña esịd Defid ete amọ akeba. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Sọlọmọn amaakeene Astọred abasianwaan mbon Sidọn, ye Molek mbubiam abasi mbon Amọn. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Ke ntoro Sọlọmọn amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>; anye ikikeeneke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd esịd, naña Defid ete amọ akenam.<verse eid="1KI 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Ke abod ke usakkautịn Yeruselem, Sọlọmọn amaabọp ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie anọ Kemos mbubiam abasi Mọb, ye Mọlek mbubiam abasi mbon Amọn. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Anye amaanam ntom anọ afịd mme isen ibaan amọ, e-ekefọppọ insensi enyʌñ enam uwa enọ mme abasi ammọ.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaayat esịd ye Sọlọmọn ke ntak a-adooho esịd amọ amaawọññọ akpọñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, a-akeyaarake idem awọt anye akañ iba. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Akpesʌkado anye amaakpan Sọlọmọn adikeene mme abasi mfen, Sọlọmọn ikinamma item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo Sọlọmọn, “Sia afo abaaha ntom ndin afo unịmme edioomo mmi ye mme ewʌhọ mmi, ake ami ñkuwuuhọ fiin, ami ñyaawaak abioubọọñ ado ñnyʌñ nnọ keed ke atu awo mfo. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Kpayeado, ke ntak Defid ete mfo, ndiinamma ke ayio uwem mfo. Ñyaawaak nsio ke ubọk ayịn mfo. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Ado ndiiwaaha afịd abioubọọñ nto anye, ado ñyaanọ anye esiin keed ke ntak Defid afʌnadeen mmi ye ke ntak Yeruselem, ake ami mmekke.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Asua Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanam asua anọ Sọlọmọn, ato ke Hadad awo Edọm, ke ufọkubọọñ Edọm. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Idaha Defid akenwanake ye Edọm, Yoab adaiso udịmekọñ, a-akekaaha edibuuk mme akpañkpa, amaawot afịd ideen ke Edọm. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoab ye afịd mbon Isrel emaebañña do afịd afiọñ itiokeed, tutu ammọ esobo afịd ideen ke Edọm. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Ado Hadad, akesʌkkọ ado etək akparawa, amaafeghe akaa Iyib ye usʌk mme adaaha Edọm e-ekenamma utom enọ ete amọ. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Ammọ emaeto Midian ekaa Paran. Ndin ammọ emaekoono mbon awo ke Paran edian idem, emaekaa Iyib, ebịne Fero adidem Iyib, a-akenọọhọ anye ufọk ye isọñ anyʌñ anọ anye ndidia.<verse eid="1KI 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Fero amaanem esịd eti-eti ye Hadad tutu anye anọ anye ataa ayịneka anwaan amọ, Abọọñanwaan Tapenes, ke ndọ. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Ayịneka Tapenes amaaman ayịn a-akekereke Kenubad, ake Tapenes akebọọhọ ke ufọkubọọñ adidem. Kenubad amaadʌñ do ye nditọ Fero.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Idaha anye akebaaha ke Iyib, Hadad amaakop ke Defid amaakebọ nduọkadudu ye mme ete amọ ndin ñko ke Yoab adaiso ekọñ amaakpa. Ndin Hadad ate Fero, “Yak ami ñka, nọ ami ntịme ñnyọñ ñka idịd mmi.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Fero amaabịp. “Nsoo ñkpọ ke afo anana ke umi a-anamma yak ayem itịmme ñka idịd ndufo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Hadad amaabọọrọ, “Ñkpọ ibaaha, ado yak ami ñka!”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Ndin Abasi amaasio asua mfen anọ Sọlọmọn, Resọn ayịn Eliada, a-akefegheke akpọñ eteufọk amọ, Hadadesa adidem Soba. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Idaha Defid akesoboke udịmekọñ Soba, Resọn ayịn Eliada amaakoono udịm awo adian idem amọ ndin akappa ado adaiwuod ammọ; ndin ammọ emaedaaña ekaa Damaskọs, ekedʌñọ do enyʌñ edat ukara. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Resọn akedo asua Isrel adaña nte Sọlọmọn akeduuho uwem, adat adian ye mfịna Hadad akenamma. Ndin Resọn amaakara ke Aram anyʌñ anie usua abaña Isrel.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerobuam Asọñ Iwuod ye Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Ñko, Yerobuam ayịn Nebad amaadakka ada anwana ye adidem. Anye akedo keed ke atu mme adaaha Sọlọmọn, awo Ifrem a-aketooho Sereda, ndin eka amọ akedo ebekpa a-akekereke Serua.<verse eid="1KI 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Kop mbʌk naña anye akenwana mi ye adidem: Sọlọmọn amaabọp mme esa anyʌñ asiit mme ufañ ke ndibene abio Defid ete amọ. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Ndin Yerobuam akedo awuọiso awo, ndin Sọlọmọn akekịt naña anye anam utom mfọn-mfọn, anye amaaben anye anịm adise ñkpọ mbaña afịd mbon utom ake mme ubon Yosef.<verse eid="1KI 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Ke ini ado Yerobuam akewuọhọ akpọñ Yeruselem, ndin Ahiya prọfed Silo asoobo anye ke usʌñ, asịne ufa afọñidem. Ammọ awo iba ekeba ikpọọñ ke abioinwañ, <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />ndin Ahiya amaaben ufa afọñidem ake anye akesịneke awai anye ke mbai duob mme iba. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Ndin anye abo Yerobuam, “Dat mbai duob nọ idem mfo, sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel abo ado ami: ‘Sese, ami ñyaawaak abioubọọñ nsio ke ubọk Sọlọmọn ndin unọ fiin esiin duob. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Ado ke ntak afʌnadeen mmi Defid ye abio Yeruselem, ami mmaakemek ke atu mme esiin Isrel, anye ayaanie esiin keed. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Ami ñyaanam ntom sia ammọ ediañña eñkpọñ miin enyʌñ ekekpono Astọred abasianwaan mbon Sidọn, Kemos abasi mme Mọb, Molek abasi mbon Amọn, ndin isañake ke ñkobitem mmi, inyʌññọ inam se inen ke iso mmi, inyʌññọ inịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme mbed mmi, naña Defid, ete Sọlọmọn, akenam.<verse eid="1KI 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />“ ‘Ado ndiibọọhọ afịd abioubọọñ ke ubọk Sọlọmọn; ami mmenam anye adaukara ke afịd ayio uwem amọ ke ntak Defid afʌnadeen mmi, ake ami ñkemekke a-akenyʌññọ anịm mme item ye mme ewʌhọ mmi. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Ami ñyaabọ ayịn amọ abioubọọñ ke ubọk ñnyʌñ unọ fiin mme esiin duob. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Ami ñyaanọ ayịn amọ esiin keed nọ Defid afʌnadeen mmi asʌk anie utuenikañ ke iso mmi ke Yeruselem, abio ake ami ñkemekke adinịm Anyịñ mmi. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Ado, amaado afo, ami ñyauben fiin, ndin afo ayaakaara ke afịd se ido udọñ esịd mfo, afo ayaado adidem ke Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Adieke afo uduunam se adodo ake ami mbo yak afo anam ndin asaña ke ñkobitem mmi anyʌñ anam se inen ke anyen mmi ke adinịm mme ewʌhọ ye mme item mmi, naña Defid afʌnadeen mmi akenam, ami ñyaaba ye afo. Ami ñyaabọp ubon ubọọñ mfo asọọñọ ada nte anye añkebọppọ nnọ Defid ñnyʌñ unọ fiin Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Ami ñyaasuuhọ ubon Defid ke ntak ami, ado idiidooho ke nsi-nsi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Sọlọmọn amaanwana adiwot Yerobuam, ado Yerobuam amaafeghe akaa Iyib, abịne adidem Sisak, anyʌñ atie do tutu ñkpa Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ñkpa Sọlọmọn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Amaado mme edinam mfen ke ini ukara Sọlọmọn, afịd se anye akenam ye aniọñ ake anye akewọttọ ado nte awo iwette isịn ke ñwed mme ubọkutom Sọlọmọn? <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Sọlọmọn amaatie ke Yeruselem akara ke afịd Isrel ke isua aba. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Ndin Sọlọmọn amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke abio Defid ete amọ. Ndin Rehoboam ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Isrel Edakka Ikọ ye Rehoboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Rehoboam amaakaa Sekem, sia afịd Isrel emaekaa do adinam anye adidem. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Yerobuam ayịn Nebad akekop ñkpọ ami (anye akeba ke Iyib, itie anye akefegheke akpọñ iso Adidem Sọlọmọn aka), anye amaato Iyib adi. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Ndin ammọ emaedọñ ekoot Yerobuam, ndin anye ye afịd mbono Isrel emaekaa ebịne Rehoboam enyʌñ ekebo anye: <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Ete mfo amainọ ñnyịn ndoppo mbiomo, ado idahami nam nsaad utom ye ndoppo akpọnọ ake anye akinọọhọ ñnyịn afeere, ndin ñnyịn iyainam ñkpọ unọ fiin.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Rehoboam amaabọọrọ, “Ikaa, ndin itịmme idi imbịne miin ke ayọhọ usen ita.” Ndin mbon ado emaenyọñọ.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Ndin Adidem Rehoboam amaakekọọk iwuod ye mme ñkpisọñ e-ekenamma utom enọ ete amọ Sọlọmọn ke ayio uwem amọ. Anye amaabịp, “Nsoo item ke ndufo ekpennọọ miin nọ mbọọrọ ibon ami?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Adieke afo adiido ayịnufọk inọ ibon ami, anyʌñ anam ñkpọ anọ ammọ, anyʌñ anọ ammọ ibọọrọ se ifọn, ammọ eyaedoñño nditọufọk mfo ke nsi-nsi.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Ado Rehoboam amaasịn item ake mme ñkpisọñ ekenọọhọ anye ndin anye amaakesoobo ye mme iwaad e-ekedooho ñka ye anye e-ekenyʌññọ enam ñkpọ enọ anye. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Anye amaabịp ammọ, “Nsoo ido item ndufo? Ñnyịn idiibọọrọ die ibon ami embooho miin, ‘Nam mbiomo e-ete mfo akinọọhọ ñnyịn afeere’?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Mme iwaad e-ekedoññoke ubọkñka ye anye emaebọọrọ, “Ibon ami edubo fiin, ‘Ete mfo amainọ ñnyịn ndodoppo mbiomo, ado nam mbiomo ñnyịn afeere.’ Idahami dọkkọ ammọ bo, ‘Etək nnuunubọk mmi akpon akan itakisịn ete mmi. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Ete mmi amaikọọñ ndufo ndodoppo akpọnọ; ami ñyaanam anye anenekke adoppo. Ete mmi akimia ndufo ke ikpa; ami ndiimia ndufo ke ikpeyen.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Usen ita akeboiyo Yerobuam ye afịd mbon awo emaetịmme ebịne Rehoboam, kpa naña adidem akebo, “Itịmme idi ke ayọhọ usen ita.” <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Adidem amaabọọrọ mbon awo ke iyadesịd. Asịn item mme ñkpisọñ ekenọọhọ anye, <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />anye amaadat item ake mme iwaad ekenọọhọ anye anyʌñ abo, “Ete mmi amaanam akpọnọ ndufo adoppo; ami ñyaanam anye anenekke adoppo. Ete mmi akimia ndufo ke ikpa; ami ndiimia ndufo ke ikpeyen.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Ndin adidem ikikpañña utọñ inọ mbon awo, sia adinam ami aketo ubonoñkpọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, nọ uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad ato Ahiya awo Silo asu.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Ndin afịd Isrel ekekịt ke adidem asịn adikpañ utọñ inọọ mmimọ, ammọ emaebọọrọ adidem:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">“Nsoo udeeme ke ñnyịn inie ye Defid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">nsoo ubaak ke ayịn Yesi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Inyọñọ mme atayad ndufo, Isrel!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Se ñkpọ baña ufọk mfo, Defid!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1KI 12:16">Ndin mbon Isrel emaenyọñọ ufọk. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Ado amaado mbon Isrel ekedʌññọ ke mme abio Yuda, Rehoboam akesʌk akakara ammọ.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Adidem Rehoboam amaadọñ Adọniram, a-akedooho aseñkpọ mbaña unyenyịk utom, ado afịd Isrel emaetọọñ anye ke itiad ewot. Ado Adidem Rehoboam amaanwana akedʌk sariọd amọ abọkkọ anyọñ Yeruselem. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Ke ntoro ke Isrel asʌk ababa ke nsọñiwuod ye ufọk Defid tutu nte usen mfịn.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Idaha afịd Isrel ekoppo ke Yerobuam amaanyọñ adi, ammọ emaedọñ ekoot anye ke mbono enyʌñ enam anye adidem ke afịd Isrel. Esiin Yuda kpọd akesọọñọ ada ye ufọk Defid.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Ke ini Rehoboam akedisịmme Yeruselem, anye amaakoot afịd Yuda ye esiin Benyamin, mme uko ñkparawa tọsịn ikie mme anaañ (180,000), edika ekọñ ye Isrel enyʌñ emaana ebọ abioubọọñ enọ Rehoboam ayịn Sọlọmọn.<verse eid="1KI 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Ado ikọ Abasi ami amaadi abịne Semaiya awo Abasi: <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Dọkkọ Rehoboam ayịn Sọlọmọn adidem Yuda, afịd Yuda ye Benyamin, ñko ye afịd mbon ñko, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />‘Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo adom: Ikiikaa ikinwana ye nditọete mfo, mbon Isrel. Inyọñ ikaa ufọk, afịd ndufo keedekeed, sia ubọkutom mmi ado ami.’ ” Ndin ammọ emaekop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> enyʌñ etịmme enyọñọ ufọk, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọ ewʌhọ.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nditọ Enañ ake Kold ke Beteel ye Daan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Ndin Yerobuam amaasọọñọ Sekem ke abod abio Ifrem anyʌñ adʌñ do. Anye aketo do awuọ akebọp Peniel.<verse eid="1KI 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Yerobuam amaakere ke esịd amọ, “Abioubọọñ akeme aditịmme ñkeene ufọk Defid. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Mbon ami ekpekaa ekenam uwa ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke Yeruselem, ammọ eyaemaana esuuk iwuod enọ abọọñ ammọ, Rehoboam adidem Yuda. Ammọ eyaeñwot miin ndin etịmme ebịne Adidem Rehoboam.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Ke anye amaakebọ item, adidem amaanam mbid ñyịnenañ iba ke kold. Anye amaabo mbon awo ate, “Ado akpọsọñ ñkpọ ndufo edidọọk ñkaa Yeruselem. Se mme abasi ndufo mi, Isrel, a-akisioho ndufo ke Iyib.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Keed anye akedaaha ke Beteel, anye ako anye adaaha ke Daan. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Ndin ñkpọ ami amaakappa idiọọkñkpọ; mbon awo emaedikpono ake Beteel enyʌñ ekaa ekewuọ Daan adikikpono anye ako.<verse eid="1KI 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Yerobuam amaabọp mme tembịd ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie anyʌñ asio mme aku ato mbon se anye amama, akpesʌkado ammọ imiikidoññoke mme Lifai. <verse eid="1KI 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yerobuam amaanịm usọrọ ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaita, nte utọ usọrọ e-ekenamma ke Yuda, anyʌñ anam mme uwa ke akpokoro uwa. Anye akenam ami ke Beteel, awa uwa anọ mme ubobod ñyịn enañ a-anye akebotto. Ndin ke Beteel anye ñko amaadot mme aku ke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ake anye akenamma. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Ke ayọhọ usen duob mme ition ke ayọhọ afiọñ itiaita, afiọñ a-anye akemekke ke idem amọ, anye amaawa mme uwa ke itieuwa a-anye akebọppọ ke Beteel. Ke ntoro anye amaanịm usọrọ ado anọ mbon Isrel anyʌñ adọọk akaa itieuwa akenọ mme enọ.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Awo Abasi A-atooho Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Ato ke ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> awo Abasi amaato Yuda adika Beteel, naña Yerobuam akedaaha ke mben akpokoro uwa adinọ enọ. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Ato ke ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anye amaasua anọ akpokoro uwa: “Akpokoro uwa, akpokoro uwa! Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: ‘Ayịn awodeen e-ekoodo Yosaiya ayaamana anọ ufọk Defid. Ke afo anye ayaawa mme aku ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie e-enamma uwa mi, ndin eyaefọp mme akpọ awo ke idem mfo.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Kpasʌk ke usen ado awo Abasi ado amaanọ idiọọñọ: “Anyem ado idiọọñọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeyaarake: Akpokoro uwa ayaabakka ke ikpeghe iba ndin eyaeduọk mme ntọñ a-adoroke ke anye.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Ke ini Adidem Yerobuam akekoppo se awo Abasi aketañ abaña akpokoro uwa ke Beteel, anye amaanyan ubọk amọ ato akpokoro uwa anyʌñ abo, “Imʌm anye!” Ado ubọk a-anye akesioho anyan awo Abasi ado amaadiappa, ndin anye ikikanna idʌt ubọk ado aba idat. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Ñko, akpokoro uwa amaasakka mbai-mbai ndin ntọñ amọ amaaduọkkọ kpa naña idiọọñọ awo Abasi akenọọhọ akedo ato ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="1KI 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Ndin adidem amaabo awo Abasi, “Kpe <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo ubọk nnọ nyʌñ bọñ akam nnọ miin yak ubọk mmi amaana anie uwem naña akeba akpa.” Ndin awo Abasi amaakpe ubọk anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin ubọk amọ amaamaana anie uwem naña akeba akpa.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Adidem amaabo awo Abasi, “Di yak ika ufọk mmi ikidia ndidia ndin ami ñyaunọ fiin enọ.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Ado awo Abasi ado amaabọọrọ adidem, “Akpekọm ayem innọ mbakka iba inie mfo, ñkpukeeneke, ñnyʌññọ ndia ñkpọ me ñnwọñ mmọọñ mi. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Sia uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amañkpan: ‘Inaaha adia ñkpọ me anwọñ mmọọñ me asaña usʌñ akesañake adi anyọñ.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Ke ntoro anye amaasaña usʌñ mfen inyʌññọ isaña ke usʌñ a-anye aketooho adi Beteel.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Ndin amaaba prọfed keed a-akedʌññọ ke Beteel a-adooho amaasọñ, ake nditọ amọ ekedidọkkọke anye afịd ñkpọ se awo Abasi akenam usen ado. Ammọ emaenyʌñ edọkkọ anye se anye akebo adidem. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Ete ammọ amaabịp ammọ, “Usʌñ uke ke anye akedʌk?” Ndin nditọ ideen amọ emaewọt anye usʌñ awo Abasi a-aketooho Yuda akedʌkkọ. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Ndin anye amaabo nditọ amọ ate, “Ibeeñe dọñki idem innọ.” Ke ammọ emaekebeeñe dọñki idem ima, anye amaadọọk anye <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />anyʌñ awat abịne awo Abasi ado. Anye amaakịt anye naña atie ke idak afriyo keed ndin amaabịp, “Afo ado awo Abasi a-aketooho Yuda adi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami ke ado.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Ndin aku amaabo anye, “Di ika ufọk mmi ikidia ñkpọ.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Awo Abasi ado amaabo, “Ami ñkemeke ikanna iso ntịmme ukeene fiin, me edidia ñkpọ me edinwọñ mmọọñ ye afo ke itie ami. <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />Emaembo eto uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: ‘Inaaha afo adia ñkpọ me anwọñ mmọọñ do me amaana asaña usʌñ akesañake adi anyọñ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Prọfed akesọññọ mi amaabọọrọ, “Ami ñko ndo aku, kpa naña afo ado. Ndin enyere amambo miin ato uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: ‘Dat anye di ufọk mfo nọ anye adidia ñkpọ anyʌñ anwọñ mmọọñ.’ ” (Ado anye akesʌhọ nsu anọ anye.) <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Ndin awo Abasi ado amaatịmme akeene anye akedia anyʌñ anwọñ ke ufọk amọ.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Idaha ammọ ekesʌkkọ edia ñkpọ, uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm akaan prọfed a-akedatta anye anyọñ adi. <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Anye asio ñkpo adọkkọ awo Abasi a-aketooho Yuda adi, “Se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo ado ami: ‘Afo amesọñ iwuod ye uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> unyʌññọ unam item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo unọọhọ fiin. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Afo amaatịmme adi adidia anyʌñ anwọñ ke itie a-anye akebooho kuudia kuunyʌñ unwọñ. Ke ntak ado akpo mfo idiibʌhọke ke udi mme eteete mfo.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Ke awo Abasi ado amaakedia ñkpọ ima anyʌñ anwọñ ama, prọfed a-akedatta anye adi amaabeeñe dọñki amọ anọ anye. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Ke ini anye asʌkkọ aka ke usʌñ, ekpe amaasoobo anye anyʌñ awot anye, ndin akpo amọ amaanaa ke usʌñ, ndin dọñki ye ekpe eda ke mben ado. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Usʌk awo ekeboiyoke emaekịt akpo naña ana do, ndin ekpe ada ke mben akpo ado, ndin ammọ emaekaa ekedọkkọ ke abio ake akaan prọfed akedʌññọ.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Ke ini prọfed a-akedatta anye ke isañ amọ atịmme adi akekoppo abaña ami, anye amaabo, “Ado awo Abasi a-akesọññọ iwuod ye ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-ayaak anye anọ ekpe, ndin ekpe awot anye anyʌñ ata anye, kpa naña ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ abaña.”<verse eid="1KI 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Aku ado amaabo nditọ ideen amọ, “Idiọñ dọñki innọ,” ndin ammọ emaenam ntoro. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Ndin anye amaawuọ akaa akekịt akpo amọ naña ana ke usʌñ, ekpe ye dọñki naña eda ke ñkañ amọ. Ekpe ikitaaha akpo inyʌññọ ikịm dọñki. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Ndin prọfed amaaben akpo awo Abasi ado, adot ke dọñki, ndin aben anye atịmme adi abio amọ adi adifʌhọ anye ñnyʌñ mbuuk anye. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ndin anye amaanịm akpo amọ ke udi amọ, ndin ammọ efʌhọ anye enyʌñ ete, “O mbọm, ayịnete mmi!”<verse eid="1KI 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Ke emaekebuuk awo Abasi ado, anye amaabo nditọ ideen amọ, “Ami mmaakpa, imbuuk miin ke udi a-awo Abasi ami abʌhọke; ibon akpọ mmi idian akpọ amọ. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Sia etob anye akenọọhọ ato uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abaña akpokoro uwa ke Beteel ye afịd mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie ke mme abio Sameria ayaasu ke akpanikọ.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Kpa ke ami amaakeboiyo, Yerobuam ikikpəhoke ndiọi usʌñ amọ, ado inikeed mfen anye amaamek mme aku ato mme nsio-nsio awo anọ mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie. Awo akeekeyeyem adido aku anye amaadiọñ anọ ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Ami akedo idiọọkñkpọ u-ufọk Yerobuam akenamma nọ anye aduọ enyʌñ esobo anye esio ke iso isọñ.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Ahiya Atañ Ñkukịd abaña Yerobuam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Ke ini ado Abiya ayịn Yerobuam amaadidọñọ, <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />ndin Yerobuam amaabo anwaan amọ, “Kaa, dịp idem mfo, mbaak edidiọọñọ ke ado anwaan Yerobuam. Ndin kaa Silo. Prọfed Ahiya aba do, anye a-akebooho ke ami ndiido adidem nnọọ ibon ami. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Ben idem uyo duob, mme kek ye atu adanakwọọk keed, nyʌñ kaa bịne anye. Anye ayaudọkkọ se idiitịppe inọ ayịn ado.” <verse eid="1KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Ndin anwaan Yerobuam amaanam se anye akebo anyʌñ akaa ufọk Ahiya ke Silo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:4">Ndin Ahiya ikimọọnọke usʌñ; anyen amọ amaakappa nnan sia anye amaasọñ. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadọkkọ Ahiya, “Anwaan Yerobuam asʌk adi adibịp mbaña ayịn amọ, sia anye adọdọñọ, ndin ana anọ anye ibọọrọ ntom. Anye amaadiwuọ, anye adiinam nte ido awo mfen.”<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Ndin ke ini Ahiya akekoppo uyio ikpadisañ amọ ke inuausʌñ, anye ate, “Dʌk di, anwaan Yerobuam. Nsoo ido ntak ñkara ami? Endọñ miin idiọọk etob unọ fiin. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Kaa, dọkkọ Yerobuam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo: ‘Ami mmaudịppe fiin nsio ke atu mme awo ñnyʌñ umek fiin adaukara anọ mbon mmi Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Ami mmaawaak abioubọọñ nsio ke ufọk Defid ndin mmaaben unọ fiin, ado afo ubaaha nte afʌnadeen mmi Defid, a-akenịmme mme item mmi anyʌñ añkeene miin ke afịd esịd amọ, anam se inen ke iso mmi kpọd. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Afo amenam mme isen abasi anọ idem mfo, mme ubobodñkpọ e-ekamake ukwak enam; afo amenam esịd añyat miin ndin amewọññọ edem mfo añwọt miin.<verse eid="1KI 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />“ ‘Ke ntak ami, ami ñyaasịn nsobo ke ufọk Yerobuam. Ami ñyaawot afịd akpatre ayịn awodeen ke Isrel, ye ke adooho afʌn me amanaisọñ. Ami ñyaafọp ufọk Yerobuam nte awo afọp uduañ, tutu anye asop afịd. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Mme ewa eyaeta mbon Yerobuam e-ekpaaha ke abio, ndin mme inuen eyaeta mbon e-ekpaaha ke esịdidʌñ. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ!’<verse eid="1KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />“Amaado afo, tịmme nyọñ ufọk. Umaudodot ñkpad ke abio mfo, ayịn awodeen ado ayaakpa. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Afịd Isrel eyaefʌhọ anye ndin ebuuk anye, sia anye ikpọọñ ke ubon Yerobuam ke edibuuk, sia anye ikpọọñ ke ufọk Yerobuam ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, akịt se ifọn.<verse eid="1KI 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />“<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaasio adidem anọ idem amọ ke Isrel adiidiañña ubon Yerobuam isio. Atọtọọñọ aditịppe idahami. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaafʌnnọ Isrel, anye ayaatie nte ñnyanyaha anyeeñeke ke mmọọñ. Anye ayaawịppe Isrel asio ke eti isọñ ami ake anye akenọọhọ mme eteete ammọ anyʌñ asuan ammọ abọhọ Inyañ Yufretis, sia ammọ edemme ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke edinam mme abai Asera. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />Ndin anye ayaasaana Isrel ayaak ke ntak ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam anamma Isrel enam.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Ndin anwaan Yerobuam amaadakka ada akaa Tiasa. Anye akesʌk adodot ukod ke esaufọk, ayịn ado amaakpa. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Ammọ emaebuuk anye, ndin afịd Isrel emaefʌhọ anye, kpa naña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ ato afʌnadeen amọ prọfed Ahiya.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yerobuam, mme ekọñ ye naña anye akekara, ewet esịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Yerobuam amaakara ke isua edịb mme iba ndin akeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ. Ndin Nadab ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rehoboam Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Rehoboam ayịn Sọlọmọn akedo adidem ke Yuda. Anye akedo isua aba mme keed idaha anye akedooho adidem, anyʌñ akara isua duob mme itiaba ke Yeruselem, abio ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akemekke asio ke atu afịd esiin Isrel nọ anịm Anyịñ Amọ. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Naama; anye akedo awonwaan Amọn.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Yuda amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ato ke idiọọkñkpọ a-ammọ ekenamma ammọ emaedemme iyadesịd ufịb amọ akan naña mbon usen edem ekenam. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Ammọ emaenyʌñ enam mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie enọ idem ammọ, mme asaña-asaña itiad ye abai Asera ke afịd abod ye ke idak eto a-atarake. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Mme akpara ideen emaekeene eba ke abio; mme awo emaenam nsio-nsio mbubiam ido ake mme idịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebịnne asio ke iso mbon Isrel.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Ke ayọhọ isua ition ke ukara Adidem Rehoboam, Sisak adidem Iyib amaanwana ye Yeruselem. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Anye amaakoono mme ñkpọuto ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye mme ñkpọuto ke ufọk adidem. Anye amaakoono afịd ñkpọ, wuọ mme atuekọñ kold Sọlọmọn akenaññake. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Ke ntak ado, Adidem Rehoboam amaanam mme atuekọñ ke akpoho nọ ekama ekpuuño mbon e-ekekoonoke do anyʌñ abakka ammọ anọ mme adaiso mbon ukpeme e-ebaaha ke utom ke inuaatob ufọkadidem. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Ini akeedodo adidem akesikaaha tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mbon ukpeme ekesikama mme atuekọñ ado, emaema ekoono ammọ ekebono ke ufọk ukpeme.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen e-ekenamma ke ukara Rehoboam, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ammọ isịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Ekọñ akekaaka iso aba ke ufọọd Rehoboam ye Yerobuam. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Ndin Rehoboam amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ye ammọ ke Abio Defid. Eka amọ akekere Naama; anye akedo awonwaan Amọn. Ndin ayịn Rehoboam, Abiya, akedat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abiya Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaita ke ukara Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, Abiya amaado adidem Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua ita. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Maaka ayịn awonwaan Abisalọm.<verse eid="1KI 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Anye amaanam afịd idiọọkñkpọ se ete amọ akenam mbemiso anye; esịd amọ ikinekkeke isịne ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amọ, naña esịd Defid etebom amọ akedo. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Kpayeado, ke ntak Defid <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi amọ amaanọ anye utuenikañ ke Yeruselem ke adidịppe ayịn amọ adidat itie amọ ñnyʌñ nnam Yeruselem asọọñọ ada. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Sia Defid amaanam se ifọn ke iso Abasi inyʌññọ itre adinịm item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndomokeed ke afịd ayio uwem amọ ibọhọke ke ake Yuria awo Hed.<verse eid="1KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Ekọñ amaanwana ke ufọọd Abiya ye Yerobuam ke afịd ayio uwem Abiya. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen aketịppeke ke ukara Abiya (asʌkkọ ado Abiyam) ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo ikiwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? Ekọñ amaanwana ke ufọọd Abiya ye Yerobuam. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Ndin Abiya (asʌkkọ ado Abiyam) amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ke Abio Defid. Ndin Asa ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asa Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb ke ukara Yerobuam adidem Isrel, Asa amaado adidem Yuda, <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua aba mme keed. Ekaeka amọ akekere Maaka ayịn awonwaan Abisalọm.<verse eid="1KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Asa amaanam se ikifọn ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, kpa naña ete amọ Defid akenam. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Anye amaabịne mme akpara ideen ke ñwommo asio ke isọn anyʌñ asịññe afịd mme ubobodñkpọ ake mme eteete amọ ekenamma. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Anye amaadooro ekaeka amọ Maaka asio nte abọọñanwaan sia anye amaabot ataa mbubiam ñkpọ a-aketekke awo esịd nọ edat ekpono ndem Asera. Asa amaakpịkke anye aduọk anyʌñ afọp anye ke Abedeñ Kidrọn. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Akpesʌkado anye imiikisịññeke mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie, esịd Asa amaasọọñọ ada adikpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke afịd ayio uwem amọ. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Anye amaakoono silfa ye kold ye mme ñkpoduoho ufọk ake anye ye ete amọ ekediọññọ asaña-asaña ebono adidọñ ke tembịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Ekọñ amaaba ke ufọọd Asa ye Baasa adidem Isrel ke afịd ini ukara ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Baasa adidem Isrel amaadakka adọọk akaa anwan ye Yuda amaanyʌñ asọọñọ Rama ada mbaak awo ndomokeed adiwọwuọ me adidọdʌk isọñ Asa adidem Yuda.<verse eid="1KI 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Asa ndin amaakekoono afịd silfa ye kold a-akesʌhọke ke itie unịm inie <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ye ake ufọkadidem amọ. Anye amaayaak asịn ke ubọk mme adaaha amọ nọ eben esọk Ben-Hadad ayịn Tabrimọn, ayịn Hesiọn, adidem Aram, a-akekarake ke Damaskọs. <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />Anye amaabo, “Yak edioomo aba ke ufọọd mmi ye afo,” “kpa naña akeba ke ufọọd ete mmi ye ete mfo. Se, ami mmenọ enọ silfa ye kold usọk. Idahami biat edioomo mfo ye Baasa adidem Isrel nọ anye asịññe idem añkpọñ miin.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Ben-Hadad amaanyịmme ye Adidem Asa ndin anọ mme adaiso ekọñ ekenwana ke mme abio Isrel. Anye amaakan Iyon, Daan, Ebeel Bed Maaka ye afịd Kinered adat adian ye Naftali. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Ke ini Baasa akekoppo ami, anye amaatre adibọp Rama anyʌñ atịmme edem anyọñ Tiasa. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Ndin Adidem Asa amaanọ ewʌhọ esọk afịd Yuda, isioho awo eto, ndin ammọ emaekoono esio ke Rama mme itiad ye eto Baasa akekamake do. Adidem Asa amaakama mme ñkpọ ami abọp Keba ke Benyamin, ye ke Mispa ñko.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Amaado afịd mme ñkpọ se ikitịppe ke ukara Asa, afịd se anye akenam, mme abio se anye akebọp, ado nte awo iwette isịn ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? Ado ke usọñ amọ, anye amaanie udọñọ ke ukod. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Ndin Asa amaakeduọk adudu ye mme etebom amọ ndin emaebuuk anye ye ammọ ke abio ete amọ Defid. Ndin Yehosafad ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nadab Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Nadab ayịn Yerobuam amaado adidem Isrel ke ayọhọ isua iba ke ukara Asa adidem Yuda, ndin anye amaakara Isrel isua iba. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akeene usʌñ ete amọ anyʌñ anam ukem idiọọkñkpọ ete amọ akenamma nọ Isrel enam idiọọkñkpọ.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Baasa ayịn Ahiya a-atooho ubon Isaka amaanam uduak abaña anye, anyʌñ awot anye ke Kibetọn, abio Filistia, ke ini Nadab ye afịd Isrel e-ekekannake anye ekʌk. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasa amaawot Nadab ke ayọhọ isua ita ke ukara Asa adidem Yuda anyʌñ adat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Anye akesʌk atọtọọñọ ukara, anye amaawot afịd awo ke ubon Yerobuam. Anye ikisʌhọke awo ndomokeed se inweek inweek, ado amaasobo afịd ammọ, akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akenọọhọ ato afʌnadeen Ahiya awo Silo. <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />Ami aketịppe ke ntak ndiọiñkpọ Yerobuam akenamma anyʌñ anam Isrel enam, ñko ke ntak anye akedemmeke ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Isrel.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Nadab, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ammọ ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Ekọñ amaaba ke ufọọd Asa ye Baasa adidem Isrel ke afịd ini ukara ammọ.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baasa Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Ke ayọhọ isua ita ake Asa adidem Yuda, Baasa ayịn Ahiya amaado adidem afịd Isrel ke Tiasa, ndin anye amaakara ke isua edịb mme inaañ. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Anye amaanam se idiọọk ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akeene usʌñ Yerobuam anyʌñ anam ukem idiọọkñkpọ ake Yerobuam akenamma Isrel enam.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Ndin uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm Yehu ayịn Hanani ke baña Baasa: <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Ami mmaudịppe fiin nsio ke ntọñ ñnyʌñ umek fiin adaukara nnọ mbon mmi Isrel, ado afo amaakeene usʌñ Yerobuam anyʌñ anam mbon mmi Isrel enam idiọọkñkpọ enyʌñ edemme iyadesịd mmi ato ke idiọọkñkpọ ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Ndin ami ñyaasọọk Baasa ye ufọk amọ, ndin ami ñyaanam ufọk mfo atie nte ake Yerobuam ayịn Nebad. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Mme ewa eyaeta mbon Baasa ake ekpaaha ke abio, ndin mme inuen ediita mbon se ikpa ke esịdidʌñ.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Baasa, se anye akenam ye ubọkutom amọ, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Baasa amaakeduọk adudu ye mme etebom ndin emaebuuk anye ke Tiasa. Ndin Ela ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Ke aboiyoke ado, ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaato prọfed Yehu ayịn Hanani asịm Baasa ye ufọk amọ, ke ntak afịd ndiọiñkpọ se anye akenam ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ademme iyadesịd amọ ke se anye akenam, atie nte ufọk Yerobuam ndin ñko sia anye amaasobo anye.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ela Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme itiokeed ukara Asa adidem Yuda, Ela ayịn Baasa amaado adidem ke Isrel, ndin anye amaakara ke Tiasa isua iba.<verse eid="1KI 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Simri, adaaha amọ keed, a-akeseeghe ñkpọ abaña mbaak keed ke itie iba sariọd amọ, amaaduak idiọọk uduak abaña anye. Ela akeba ke Tiasa ke ini ado, asʌk akpa mmịn ke ufọk Aasa, aseñkpọ mbaña ufọkadidem ke Tiasa. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Simri amaadʌk adi, adikịm anye ndin awot anye ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme itiaba ukara Asa adidem Yuda. Ndin anye adat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Anye aketọtọọñọ ikara ye aditie ke ebekpo ukara, anye amaawot afịd ubon Baasa. Anye ikisʌhọke ayịn ndomokeed, me imaan me ufan. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Ndin Simri amaasobo afịd ubon Baasa, akeene uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña abaña Baasa ato prọfed Yehu, <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />ke ntak afịd ndiọiñkpọ se Baasa ye ayịn amọ Ela ekenam enyʌñ enam Isrel enam, ndin ammọ edemme iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ato ke ubobodñkpọ ammọ i-imiibaaha ufọn.<verse eid="1KI 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Ela, ye afịd se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel?<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Simri Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme itiaba ke ukara Asa adidem Yuda, Simri amaakara ke Tiasa usen itiaba. Udịmekọñ ekenie nnaaekọñ akpere Kibetọn, abio Filistia. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Ke idaha mbon Isrel ke nnaaekọñ ekekoppo ke Simri amaadʌk idiọọk edioomo abaña adidem anyʌñ awot anye, ammọ emaenam Omri, adaiso udịmekọñ, ado adidem Isrel kpasʌk usen ado ke nnaaekọñ. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Ndin Omri ye afịd Isrel ye anye emaekpọñ Kibetọn ekanna Tiasa ekʌk. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Ke Simri amaakekịt ke edat abio ado, anye amaakaa akpọsọñ itie ke ufọk adidem anyʌñ akesịn ikañ ke ufọk adidem ye anye ke esịd. Ndin anye amaakpa, <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />ke ntak mme ndiọiñkpọ ake anye akenamma, anam idiọọk ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ akeene usʌñ Yerobuam anyʌñ anam afịd idiọọkñkpọ Yerobuam akenamma Isrel enam.<verse eid="1KI 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Simri, ye ubọukara ke adudu se anye akenam, ado nte awo iwette ammọ ke mme ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel?<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omri Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Ndin mbon Isrel emaebakka ke ikpeghe iba; ubaak keed ke itie iba ediana ye Tibni ayịn Kinad adido adidem, mbeñ uko ediana ye Omri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Ado mbon se ikidiana ye Omri emaesọñ adudu ekan mbon Tibni ayịn Kinad. Tibni amaakpa ndin Omri amaakappa adidem.<verse eid="1KI 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme keed ke ukara Asa adidem Yuda, Omri amaado adidem Isrel, ndin anye amaakara isua duob mme iba, itiokeed ke atu ado akedo ke Tiasa. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Anye amaadep abod Sameria ato Sema ke talen silfa iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 68</char></note> anyʌñ abọp abio ke anyọñ, akoot Sameria, akeene Sema, anyịñ akpa andikinie abod ado.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Ado Omri amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ anam idiọọkñkpọ akan mbon se ikiboiyo anye iso. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Anye amaakeene usʌñ Yerobuam ayịn Nebad, anam ukem-ukem idiọọkñkpọ ake Yerobuam akenamma Isrel enam, ado ademme iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, ato ke mme ubobodñkpọ ammọ i-imiibaaha ufọn ndomokeed.<verse eid="1KI 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Omri, se anye akenam ye mme ñkpọ se anye akenam anịm, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Omri amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ke Sameria. Ndin Ehab ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehab Ado Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Ke ayọhọ isua edịb mme duob mme itiaita ke ukara Asa adidem Yuda, Ehab ayịn Omri amaado adidem Isrel, ndin anye amaakara ke Sameria ke Isrel isua edịb mme iba. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Ehab ayịn Omri amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akan mbon se ikiboiyo anye iso. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Anye ikikịtte mme idiọọkñkpọ ake Yerobuam ayịn Nebad akenamma nte mfefeere ñkpọ ikpọọñ ke iso amọ, ado anye amaadọ Yesibeel ayịn awonwaan Etbaal adidem Sidọn, anyʌñ atọọñọ adinam ñkpọ nnọọ Baal anyʌñ akpono anye. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Anye amaabọp akpokoro uwa anọ Baal ke tembịd Baal a-anye akebọppọ ke Sameria. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Ehab amaanyʌñ anam abai Asera anyʌñ anam uwak ñkpọ adidemme iyadesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, akan afịd mme ndidem Isrel mbemiso anye.<verse eid="1KI 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Ke ini ukara Ehab, Hiel awo Beteel amaamaana adibọp Yeriko. Anye amaakama akpan amọ Abiram asịn itiad idakisọñ, ndin anye amaakama etəkayịn awodeen amọ Sekub abọp inuaatob amọ, akeene ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañña ato Yọsua ayịn Nọn.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Elaiya Anọ Etob Ekamba Ndaayio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Ndin Elaiya awo Tisbe, a-atooho Tisbe ke Kilied, amaabo Ehab, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, aduuho, a-ami nnamma ñkpọ nnọ, mbara me edịm idiibaaha ke isua ifañ adiighe ke iso ke imiibọhọke ke uyio mmi.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mme Ekọọñebʌkayob Enọ Elaiya Ndidia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm Elaiya: <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Kpọñ itie ami, wọññọ kaa ke usakkautịn nyʌñ dịbe ke Abedeñ Kerịd, ke usakkautịn Yọdan. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Afo ayaanwọñ mmọọñ ato idịm ado, ndin ami mmedọñ mme ekọọñebʌkayob unọ fiin ndidia ke ndo.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Ndin anye amaanam se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo anye anam. Anye amaakaa Abedeñ Kerịd, ke usakkautịn Yọdan, anyʌñ aba do. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Mme ekọọñebʌkayob emaeben uyo ye unam esọk anye ubakusen ye ndubiayio, ndin anye amaanwọñ mmọọñ ato idịm ado.<verse eid="1KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elaiya ye Ebekpa ke Sarefad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Akemaanako idịm ado amaadisat sia edịm ikideppe ke isọñ ado. <verse eid="1KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Ndin uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm anye: <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Kaa Sarefad inikeed ke efaak Sidọn nyʌñ ba do. Ami mmebo yak ebekpa do unọ fiin ndidia.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Ndin anye amaakaa Sarefad. Anye akediwuọ inuaatob abio, ebekpa keed akesʌk atañña ifia. Anye amaakoot anye amaanyʌñ abịp, “Afo akpaadat etək mmọọñ ke atu annọ miin yak ñnwọñ?” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Naña anye akaaha adikidat idi, anye amaakoot, “Mbọk, nyʌñ dat etək ubaak uyo nsọk.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo aduuho uwem, ami nnieghe uyo ndomokeed, sʌk ekpaubọk ndomuyo ke atu ye etək adan ọlif ke ikpəñ. Ami ntañ ntək ifia ami se mben ñnyọñ ufọk ñkenam ndidia nnọ idem mmi ye ayịn awodeen mmi, nọ ado ñnyịn imaidia ado ima ikpañña.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Elaiya amaabo anye, “Kuufeghe ndịk. Nyọñ ufọk nyʌñ kenam naña afo abo. Ado to nam etək efọk uyo nnọ miin ke atu se afo anie nyʌñ ben nsọk miin, ndin afo anam ñkpọ anọ idem mfo ye ayịn awodeen mfo. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Sia se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, abo ado ami: ‘Ndomuyo idiikweeñeke ke atu ñko adan idiisatta ke ikpəñ tutu usen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaanọ edịm yak adi isọñ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Anye amaadakka akenam naña Elaiya akebo anye. Ndin ndidia amaaba kwa usen anọ Elaiya ye awonwaan ado ye ufọk amọ. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Sia atu ndomuyo ikikweeñeke ndin adan ikinyʌññọ isat, kpa naña uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aketañ ato Elaiya.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Akemaanako ayịn awonwaan a-akenieghe ufọk ado amaadidọñọ. Idem amọ amaakaaka iso adiọọk, ndin ke akpatre anye amaadop inweek. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Awonwaan ado amaabo Elaiya, “Nsoo mfịna ke afo anie ye ami awo Abasi? Afo akedi adintoiyo miin idiọọkñkpọ mmi ñnyʌñ ñwot ayịn mmi?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Elaiya amaabọọrọ, “Nnọ ayịn mfo.” Anye amaabọ anye ke ubọk amọ, aben anye akaa ubeed anyọñ a-anye akebaaha, anyʌñ ayaak anye anịm ke akwañ amọ. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Ndin anye amaatua akoot <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi, ado nte afo amedat ukuud asọk ebekpa ami ake ami mbaaha keed mi, ke adinam akparawa amọ akpa?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Ndin anye amaanyanna idem amọ afʌk akparawa ado akañ ita anyʌñ atua anọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mmi, yak uwem akparawa atịmme abịne anye!”<verse eid="1KI 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakop ayịd Elaiya, ndin uwem akparawa ado amaatịmme adi, ndin anye amaadu. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Elaiya amaadịppe akparawa ado anyʌñ aben anye ato ubeed asọiyọ adʌk ufọk. Anye amaayaak anye anọ eka amọ ndin ate, “Se, ayịn mfo adu uwem!”<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Ndin awonwaan ado amaabo Elaiya, “Idahami ami mmediọọñọ ke afo ado awo Abasi ndin ke ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-awuọhọ ke inua mfo ado akpanikọ.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Elaiya ye Obadaiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Akekpeene ko, ke ayọhọ isua ita, uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm Elaiya: “Kaa ke wọt Ehab idem, ndin ami ñyaanọ edịm adi isọñ.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Ndin Elaiya amaakaa akewọt Ehab idem amọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Ndin akañ amaakpon eti-eti ke Sameria, <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />ndin Ehab amaakoot Obadaiya, andise ñkpọ mbaña ufọkadidem. (Obadaiya akedo awo akenịmme <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ke akpanikọ. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Ke idaha Yesibeel asʌkkọ awot mme prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Obadaiya amaakoono mme prọfed ikie adịp ammọ ke abaitiad iba, aba mme duob ke ammọ keedekeed, anyʌñ anọ ammọ ndidia ye mmọọñ.) <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Ndin Ehab amaabo Obadaiya, “Kaa ke afịd isọñ ke mme ube mmọọñ ye mme abedeñ. Akemeido imikeme adikịt mbid se enam mme enañmbakara ye mme ñyịn ñwaahadọñki eta edu uwem mbaak ñnyịn idiwot unam ñnyịn ndomokeed.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Ke ntoro ammọ emaebakka isọñ a-akenaaha ammọ esaaña ese, Ehab akaa efaak keed ndin Obadaiya adʌk efaak uko.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Obadaiya akesʌk asaña aka, Elaiya amaasoobo anye. Obadaiya amaadiọọñọ anye, anyuuk iwuod ke isọñ, ndin ate, “Elaiya abọọñ mmi, me afo ke anekke akpedo?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ntoro, kaa ke dọkkọ eteufọk mfo, ‘Elaiya mmọ mi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Obadaiya amaabịp, “Nsoo ke ami nnam ndue?” “nọ afo abiiyaak afʌnadeen mfo isịn ke ubọk Ehab nọ awot? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi mfo aduuho uwem, ibaaha idịd me abioubọọñ ake eteufọk mmi imiidọññọ yak ekuuyem fiin. Ndin idịd me abioubọọñ emaebo ke afo ubaaha ke udo, anye amaanam ammọ enwọñọ ñkpọ ebo ke mmimọ ikanna ukịt fiin. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Ado idahami afo ante miin ñka ñkedọkkọ eteufọk mmi mbo, ‘Elaiya mmọ mi.’ <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Ndiọọñọke nte Sịbidịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akeme aduben fiin ñkaa ami mmaadakka ukpọñ fiin. Adieke ami ñkaaha ñkedọkkọ Ehab ndin anye ukịtte fiin, anye ayañwot miin. Ado ami afʌnadeen mfo mmekpono <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> tọọñọ ke uyịn mmi. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Abọọñ mmi, ado nte afo ukoppo se ami ñkenam idaha Yesibeel akesʌkkọ awot mme prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>? Ami mmaadịp mme prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikie ke abaitiad iba, aba mme duob ke keed, ñnyʌñ nnọ ammọ ndidia ye mmọọñ. <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Ndin idahami afo ate ami ñka mbịne eteufọk mmi ñkebo, ‘Elaiya mmọ mi.’ Anye ayañwot miin!”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Elaiya amaabo, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Andikponñkan aduuho, ake ami nnamma ñkpọ nnọ, ami ñyaawọt Ehab idem mmi mfịn ami.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elaiya ke Abod Kamel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Ndin Obadaiya amaakaa akesoobo ye Ehab anyʌñ adọkkọ anye, ndin Ehab amaakaa adisoobo ye Elaiya. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Anye amaakekịt Elaiya, Ehab amaabo anye, “Afo ke ado, afo andifịna Isrel?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Elaiya amaabọọrọ. “Ami nnamma mfịna nnọ Isrel. Ado afo ye ufọk ete mfo enam. Afo amekpọñ item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anyʌñ akeene mme Baal. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Idahami koot mbon awo ke afịd Isrel yak edinsoobo miin ke Abod Kamel. Ndin koono mme prọfed Baal ikie inaañ mme aba mme duob ye mme prọfed Asera ikie inaañ, ediaha ñkpọ ke akpokoro Yesibeel.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Ndin Ehab amaanọ etob aka afịd Isrel anyʌñ abon mme prọfed ke Abod Kamel. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Elaiya amaakaa iso mbon awo ndin amaabo, “Adiikpeene die ndufo edibiere me ediika mbeñ uke? Adieke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-adooho Abasi, ikeene anye; ado adieke Baal adooho Abasi, ikeene anye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:21">Ado mbon awo ikibooho ñkpọ ndomokeed.<verse eid="1KI 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Ndin Elaiya amaabo ammọ, “Ami ikpọọñ ndo prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ake asʌhọke, ado Baal anie prọfed ikie inaañ mme aba mme duob (450). <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Idat ñyaaraenañ iba isọk ñnyịn. Yak mme prọfed Baal eto emek keed enọ idem ammọ, ndin yak ammọ ekpok anye ntək-ntək enyʌñ edot ke eto ado ke esịn ikañ. Ami ñyaanam enañ anye ako ñnyʌñ ndot ke eto ado nsịnne ikañ ke esịd. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Ndin ndufo ekoot anyịñ abasi ndufo, ndin ami ñyaakoot anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Abasi anye a-abọọrọke ke ikañ, anye ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Ndin afịd awo emaebo, “Se afo atañ afọn.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Elaiya amaabo mme prọfed Baal, “Imek enañ keed ito idiọñ, sia ndufo emewak. Ikoot anyịñ abasi ndufo, ado ikiidomo ikañ.” <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Ndin ammọ emaeben enañ ekenọọhọ ammọ enyʌñ ediọñ anye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:26">Ndin ammọ emaekoot anyịñ Baal tọọñọ ke ubakusen tutu uweemeayio. Ammọ emaebọñ, “Baal, bọọrọ ñnyịn!” Ado ibọọrọ ikibaaha; awo ndomokeed ikibọọrọke. Ammọ emaenyʌñ enek ekanna akpokoro uwa a-ammọ ekenamma.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Akedo ufọọd uweemeayio Elaiya amaatọọñọ adinọ ammọ ndọk. Anye amaabo, “Ibọñ ñkpo isọñ uyio! Ke akpanikọ anye ado abasi! Akemeido aba ke ekamba akikere, me anie se anam, me aka isañ. Akemeido adadaiya ndin ana etọi anye.” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Ndin ammọ emaenekke ebọñ ñkpo enyʌñ ekpok idem ammọ ke akañkañ ye eduad, naña ido ammọ akesido, tutu iyiib ammọ afiọrọ. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Ufọọd uweemeayio amaaboiyo, ammọ emaesʌk ekaa iso etañ etob tutu akem ini uwa ndubiayio. Ado ibọọrọ ndomokeed ikibaaha, awo ndomokeed ikibọọrọke, awo ndomokeed ikikpañña utọñ.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Ndin Elaiya amaabo afịd mbon awo, “Idi mi imbịne miin.” Ammọ emaedi ebịne anye, ndin anye amaadiọñ akpokoro uwa <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ake emaekewuut. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Elaiya amaakoono itiad duob mme iba, keed ada anọ esiin keedekeed a-aketooho Yekọb, ake ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akesịmme, abo “Anyịñ mfo adiido Isrel.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Anye amaakama mme itiad ado abọp akpokoro uwa ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ndin anye amaanyʌñ adọk ube a-anwañake akem adikpidọñọ udomo ñkpasi iba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 11</char></note> akanna anye. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Anye amaaneeñe eto abono, akpok enañ ntək-ntək ndin adoot ke eto ado. Ndin anye amaabo ammọ, “Idọñ mmọọñ ayọhọ ñkpoon atu inaañ inyʌñ inwañña iduọk ke uwa ye ke eto.”<verse eid="1KI 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Anye amaabo, “Imaana inam,” ndin ammọ emaemaana enam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:34">Anye amaanọ uyio, “Imaana inam ayọhọ akañ ita,” ndin ammọ emaemaana enam ayọhọ akañ ita. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Mmọọñ amaafiọrọ akanna akpokoro uwa anyʌñ ayọhọ ube.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Ke ini unam uwa, prọfed Elaiya amaawuọ ada ndin amaabọñ akam: “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Ebraham, Aisik ye Isrel, yak ediọọñọ mfịn ke afo ado Abasi ke Isrel ndin ke ami ndo afʌnadeen mfo ndin ke nnam afịd mme ñkpọ ami ke item mfo. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Mbọọrọ miin, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, mbọọrọ miin, nọ ibon ami ediọọñọ ke afo, <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado Abasi, ndin ke afo amaana awọññọ ammọ esịd etịmme edi.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Ndin ikañ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaaduọ anyʌñ afọp uwa, eto, mme itiad ye ntan, anyʌñ adai mmọọñ ke ube.<verse eid="1KI 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Afịd awo ekekịt ami, ammọ emaeduọññọ ke isọñ etua, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anye ado Abasi! <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> anye ado Abasi!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Ndin Elaiya amaanọ ammọ ewʌhọ, “Imʌm mme prọfed Baal. Ikiiyak awo ndomokeed afeghe!” Ammọ emaemʌm ammọ, ndin Elaiya amaanam ekoono ammọ edi Abedeñ Kisọn ndin ewoot ammọ do.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Ndin Elaiya amaabo Ehab, “Kaa, dia ñkpọ nyʌñ nwọñ, sia uyio ekamba edịm mmọdo.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Ndin Ehab amaadakka adikidia ñkpọ ñnyʌñ ñnwọñ, ado Elaiya amaadọọk anyọñ Kamel, anʌhọ ke isọñ anyʌñ asịn iso amọ ke ufañ edọñ amọ iba.<verse eid="1KI 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Anye amaabo ayịnufọk amọ, “Kaa ke se inyañ.” Ndin anye amaadọọk akaa akese.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Anye amaabo, “Ñkpọ ibaaha do.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Akañ itiaba Elaiya amaabo, “Tịmme kaa.”<verse eid="1KI 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Ayọhọ akañ itiaba ayịnufọk amaabo, “Ntọñanyọñ ake asịppe nte ubọk awo asʌk awuọ ato inyañ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Ndin Elaiya amaabo, “Kaa nyʌñ dọkkọ Ehab, ‘Beeñe sariọd mfo nyʌñ nyọñ mbaak edịm adubiọọñọ fiin.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Idaha ado, ikpaanyọñ amaakịm ye ntọñanyọñ, afịm adakka, ekamba edịm atọọñọ adidep ndin Ehab amaawat akaa Yesriil. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Adudu <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadoro Elaiya ndin anye amaanuuk afọñ amọ adọñ ke ñkpaha amọ, afeghe abọhọ Ehab tutu akewuọ Yesriil.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Elaiya Afeghe Akaa Họreb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Akema Ehab amaadọkkọ Yesibeel afịd ñkpọ se Elaiya akenam ye naña anye akewot afịd mme prọfed ke akañkañ. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Ndin Yesibeel amaadọñ isʌñutom utom anọ Elaiya ate, “Yak mme abasi enam ye ami, akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ, akpedo awuọ ñkpọñ idaha ntom ami nnamma uwem mfo atie nte keed ke atu ammọ.”<verse eid="1KI 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Elaiya amaakop ndịk anyʌñ afeghe ke ntak uwem amọ. Anye akediwuọ Beeseba ke Yuda, anye amaakpọñ ayịnufọk amọ ke udo, <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />ke ini anye ke idem amọ amaakesaña isañ usen keed akaa anaan. Anye amaadiwuọ itie eto ayañ, asuuk atie ke idak amọ anyʌñ abọñ akam ate yak ikpa. Anye amaabo, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ami mmekpa mba. Dat uwem mmi; ami mfọnnọ ñkan mme eteete mmi.” <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Ndin anye amaasuuk anaa ke idak ikọd nsadañ anyʌñ adaiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:5">Ndin inikeed enyere amaatuuk anye ndin abo, “Dakka da nyʌñ dia ñkpọ.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Anye amaase ñkanñkʌk, ndin ke mben iwuod amọ akedo uyo emaeketem ke ufiob ukañ, ye atu mmọọñ. Anye amaadia anyʌñ anwọñ ndin amaana asuuk anaa.<verse eid="1KI 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />Ndin enyere <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaatịmme adi ayọhọ akañ iba anyʌñ atuuk anye ndin ate, “Dakka da nyʌñ dia, sia isañ ayaukak fiin.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Ndin anye amaadakka ada ndin amaadia anyʌñ anwọñ. Ndidia ado amaanọ anye inweek, anye amaasaña usen aba ye akonayio aba tutu anye akewuọ Họreb, abod Abasi. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Ke udo anye amaadʌk abaitiad keed akedaiya akonayio ado.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1KI 19:9">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Awọt Elaiya Idem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Ndin uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm anye: “Elaiya, nsoo ke afo anam ke mmi?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmenekke nsịn ifịk mbaña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan. Mbon Isrel esịn edioomo mfo, ewuut mme akpokoro uwa mfo, enyʌñ ewot mme prọfed mfo ke akañkañ. Ami kpọd nsʌhọ, ndin idahami ammọ eyem ediñwot miin ñko.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “Saña wuọ nyʌñ kaa keda ke anyọñ abod ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaadiboiyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:11">Ndin ekamba ye akpọsọñ ayobio amaaboom mme ikpọabod anyʌñ asuan mme ikpọitiad ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikisịneke ke ayobio ado. Ke ayobio amaakeboiyo unyekisọñ amaatịppe, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikisịneke ke unyekisọñ ado. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Ke unyekisọñ amaakeboiyo ikañ amaadi, ado <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ikisịneke ke ikañ ado. Ndin ke ikañ amaakeboiyo sʌñ-sʌñ uyio adu amaadi. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Elaiya akekop ami, anye amaatuut afọñ amọ afʌk iso amọ ndin amaawuọ akeda ke inuaatob abaitiad ado.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:13">Ndin uyio amaabo anye, “Elaiya, nsoo ke afo anam ke mmi?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Anye amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmenekke nsịn ifịk mbaña <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> Abasi Andikponñkan. Mbon Isrel esịn edioomo mfo, ewuut mme akpokoro uwa mfo, enyʌñ ewot mme prọfed mfo ke akañkañ. Ami kpọd nsʌhọ, ndin idahami ammọ eyem ediñwot miin ñko.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo anye, “Tịmme kaa usʌñ a-afo aketooho adi, nyʌñ kaa ke Akpautatan Damaskọs. Afo amaakesịm do, yet Hasel adan nte adidem Aram. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Ñko, yet Yehu ayịn Nimsi nọ ado adidem Isrel, ndin yet Elisa ayịn Safad ke Ebeel Mehola adidat itie mfo nte prọfed. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Yehu ayaawot awo ndomokeed a-abọkkọke eduad Hasel, ndin Elisa ayaawot awo akeedodo a-abọkkọke akañkañ Yehu. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Ado ami mmesʌhọ awo tọsịn itiaba (7,000) ke Isrel, afịd mbon ake imiitọọñọke edọñ ammọ inọ Baal ye mbon ake imiitʌmmọ anye inua.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikood Elisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Ndin Elaiya amaakpọñ do akekịt Elisa ayịn Safad. Anye akesʌk afʌñ isọñ ye mme akpọnọ abaakenañ utominwañ duob mme iba, anye ke idem amọ akewat ayọhọ duob mme iba ado. Elaiya amaasaña akpere anye ndin atop afọñ amọ afʌk anye. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Ndin Elisa amaadakka akpọñ ayaaraenañ amọ afeghe akeene Elaiya. Anye amaabo, “Yak ñkọọm ete ye eka mmi etie sʌñ, ndin ñyaadukeene fiin.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Elaiya amaabọọrọ, “Tịmme edem. Nsoo ke ami unam fiin?”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Ndin Elisa amaatịmme akpọñ anye anyʌñ anyọñ. Anye amaakoono mme akpọnọ ñyaaraenañ amọ anyʌñ awot ammọ. Anye amaafọp ñkpọ ufʌñ isọñ akama afọp unam ado anọ mbon awo, ammọ emaenyʌñ eta. Ndin anye amaadibeeñe idem adikeene Elaiya anyʌñ akappa ado ayịnufọk amọ.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ben-Hadad Anwana Ekọñ ye Sameria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Ndin Ben-Hadad adidem Aram amaakoot afịd udịmekọñ amọ. Mme ndidem edịb mme duob mme iba ye mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd ammọ ekekeene anye ekanna Sameria ekʌk enyʌñ enwana ekọñ ye anye. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Anye amaadọñ mme isʌñutom eka esịd abio ebịne Ehab adidem Isrel, ate, “Se Ben-Hadad atañ adom: <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Silfa ye kold mfo ennie miin, ye ibaan mfo ye nditọ se ifọọn ikan, ennie miin.’ ” Ben-Hadad atañ.<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ, “Ado naña afo abo ado, abọọñ mmi adidem. Ami ye afịd se nnie unie fiin.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Mme isʌñutom emaetịmme edi edibo, “Se Ben-Hadad atañ adom: ‘Ami mmaadọñ edibọ silfa ye kold mfo, ibaan mfo ye nditọ mfo. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Ado ñkpọñ idaha ntom ami ñyaadọñ mme adaaha mmi yak ediyeem ufọkadidem ye mme ufọk mme adaaha mfo. Ammọ eyaekoono afịd ñkpọ se afo ama enyʌñ ebiom esio.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Adidem Isrel amaakoot afịd mme ñkpisọñ ke abio ndin abo ammọ, “Se naña ete ami atọọñọ ñyemikọ! Idaha ake anye akedọññọ edikoono mme ibaan mmi ye nditọ mmi, silfa mmi ye kold mmi, ñkesịnne anye.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Mme ñkpisọñ ye afịd mbon awo emaebọọrọ ete, “Kuukpañ utọñ unọọ anye kuunyʌñ unyịmme unọọ se anye ayem.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Anye ndin amaabọọrọ mme isʌñutom Ben-Hadad, “Dọkkọ abọọñ mmi adidem, ‘Afʌnadeen mfo ayaanam afịd se afo akeyem akpa ini ado, ado amaado anyem ami ndiikanna nnam se afo ayem.’ ” Ammọ emaenyọñọ enyʌñ eben ibọọrọ ado esọk Ben-Hadad.<verse eid="1KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Ndin Ben-Hadad amaadọñ etob mfen asọk Ehab: “Yak mme abasi enam ye ami, akpọsọñ-akpọsọñ, akpedo ntọñ ayaasʌhọ ke Sameria se ikem mbon mmi ekpaubọk keed.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ, “Dọkkọ anye: ‘Awo a-asịneke atuekọñ amọ akuukpọọ inua nte awo a-asioho anye anịm.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Ben-Hadad akebọ etob ami idaha anye ye mme ndidem ekesʌkkọ enwọñ ñkpọ ke mme atayad, ndin anye amaanọ ideen amọ ewʌhọ: “Ibeeñe idem edinwana.” Ndin ammọ emaebeeñe idem edinwana ye abio.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ehab Akan Ben-Hadad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Akema prọfed keed amaakaa abịne Ehab adidem Isrel anyʌñ akenọ etob, “Kop se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo mi: ‘Afo amekịt ekamba udịmekọñ ami? Ami ñyaayaak nsịn ke ubọk mfo mfịn, ndin afo ayaadiọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ehab amaabịp, “Ado anie adiinam ami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Prọfed amaabọọrọ, “Kop se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: ‘Mme iwaad ke ekọñ ke idak mme adaiso mbon ekọñ ediinam.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Anye amaabịp, “Ndin anie adiitọọñọ ekọñ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Prọfed amaabọọrọ, “Afo uduutọọñọ.”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Ndin Ehab amaakoot mme etubom iwaad ekọñ awo ikie iba mme edịb mme duob mme iba (232) ke idak mme adaiso mbon ekọñ. Ndin anye amaakoono mbon Isrel abok, mbon se ikiyọhọ isʌhọ, awo tọsịn itiaba (7,000) ke afịd. <verse eid="1KI 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Ammọ emaetọọñọ isañ ufọọd uweemeayio ke ini Ben-Hadad ye mme ndidem edịb mme duob mme iba ekedianake ye anye ekebaaha ke mme atayad ammọ esʌk enwọñ ukọd, ukọd anyʌñ asʌk anaam ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Mme etubom iwaad ke idak mme adaiso mbon ekọñ eketo ewuọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:17">Ndin Ben-Hadad amaadọñ mme uyeb, ekedibooho, “Mme ideen esʌk esaña eto Sameria edi.”<verse eid="1KI 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Anye amaabo, “Adieke ammọ ediighe ke emem, imʌm ammọ ye uwem; adieke ammọ ediighe ke ekọñ, imʌm ammọ ye uwem.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Mme etubom iwaad ekọñ ke idak mme adaiso mbon ekọñ emaesaña ewuọ ke abio ye udịmekọñ ke edem ammọ; <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />awo keedekeed amaawot nsakiso awo amọ. Aketịppe ntoro, mbon Aram emaefeeñe, ndin mbon Isrel emaebịne ammọ. Ado Ben-Hadad adidem Aram amaadoro ke edem enañmbakara afeghe abọkkọ ye usʌk mme awad enañmbakara amọ. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Adidem Isrel amaakaa iso anyʌñ akan mme enañmbakara ye mme sariọd anyʌñ anam mbon Aram enie uwak ntakudua.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Ado akeboiyo, prọfed ado amaadibịne adidem Isrel ndin abo, “Sọọñọ itie mfo, nyʌñ se se ana nte enam, sia isua mfen adidem Aram ayaamaana adi ekọñ ye afo.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Ke ini ado, mme adaaha adidem Aram emaenọ anye item, “Mme abasi ammọ edo mme abasi abod. Ntak ado akenam ammọ esọñ adudu ikan ñnyịn. Ado adieke ñnyịn inwanake ye ammọ ke unaisọñ, ke akpanikọ ñnyịn iyaisọñ adudu ikan ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Nam ntom: Sio afịd mme ndidem ke ikpeghe ekọñ ammọ nyʌñ ben mme etubom mbon ekọñ sịn do. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Ana afo anie udịmekọñ ukem-ukem ye mbon afo akeduọhọ, enañmbakara ke enañmbakara ye sariọd ke sariọd, nọ ñnyịn ikan inwana ye Isrel ke unaisọñ. Ndin ke akpanikọ ñnyịn iyaikop adudu ikan ammọ.” Anye amaanyịmme ye ammọ anyʌñ anam ntoro.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Akekappa adiwuọ ini ndaayio Ben-Hadad amaakoono mbon Aram anyʌñ adọọk akaa Afek adikinwana ye Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Emaenyʌñ ekoono mbon Isrel enyʌñ enọ mme ñkpọ, ammọ emaewuọ ekaa edisoobo ammọ. Mbon Isrel emaeba ke nnaaekọñ a-asakkaiso ase ammọ nte ntək udịm ebod, ke ini mbon Aram ekeyọhọke afịd isọñ.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Awo Abasi amaadọọk adidọkkọ adidem Isrel, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> atañ: ‘Sia mbon Aram ekereke ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ado abasi abod idooho ake abedeñ, ami ñyaayaak uwak udịmekọñ ami nsịn ke ubọk mfo, ndin afo ayaadiọọñọ ke ami ndo <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Ke usen itiaba ammọ emaesak iso ese emọ-emọ, ndin ke ayọhọ usen itiaba ekọñ amaanwana. Mbon Isrel emaesobo awo tọsịn ikie ake mbon Aram ke usen keed. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Mbon se ikisʌhọ emaefeeñe ekaa abio Afek, ake ndibene akeduọhọ awot awo ammọ tọsịn edịb mme itiaba (27,000). Ndin Ben-Hadad amaafeghe anyọñ abio akedịbe ke esịd ubeed.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Mme adaaha amọ emaebo anye, “Se, ñnyịn imikop ke mme ndidem Isrel edo mme atua awo mbọm. Yak ñnyịn ibịne adidem Isrel ikịne afọñikpo ke isịn ñnyịn inyʌñ itobo udʌk ke iwuod ñnyịn. Akemeido anye ayaunịm fiin uwem.”<verse eid="1KI 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Ammọ emaekịne afọñikpo ke isịn enyʌñ etobo udʌk ke iwuod, ammọ emaebịne adidem Isrel ndin ekebo, “Afʌnadeen mfo Ben-Hadad abo: ‘Mbọk yak ndu uwem.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Adidem amaabọọrọ, “Anye nsʌk mmọ ke uwem? Anye ado ayịneka mmi awodeen.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Ideen ado emaedat ami nte eti idiọọñọ enyʌñ esọsọp edat ikọ amọ. Ammọ emaebo, “Ntoro, ayịneka mfo awodeen Ben-Hadad!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Adidem amaabo, “Ikaa ikiben anye idi.” Ndin Ben-Hadad amaakewuọ adi, Ehab anam anye adidʌk sariọd amọ.<verse eid="1KI 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Ben-Hadad amaabo, “Ami ñyaatịmme ñkpọñ mme abio ake ete mmi akebọiyọ ete mfo unọ. Amekeme adinịm mme itie udua mfo ke Damaskọs, kpa naña ete mmi akenam ke Sameria.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Ehab amaabo, “Ke ntak edioomo ami ñyausaana fiin ñyaak.” Ndin anye amaanam edioomo ye anye, anyʌñ ayaak anye anyọñ.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Prọfed Asua Anọ Ehab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Ato ke uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> keed ke atu mme nditọ prọfed amaabo nsaña amọ, “Ñyʌppọ miin ke ñkpọekọñ mfo,” ado anye amaasịn.<verse eid="1KI 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Ndin prọfed amaabo, “Sia afo umuukoppo item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, umausʌk udadakka uñkpọñ miin ekpe ayauwot fiin.” Ndin ete ado akekpọñ, ekpe amaakịt anye anyʌñ awot anye.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Prọfed amaakịt awodeen mfen anyʌñ abo, “Ñyʌppọ miin, mbọk.” Ndin ete ado amaayʌppọ anye anyʌñ anọ anye unan. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Ndin prọfed ado amaakaa akeda ke mben usʌñ abet adidem. Anye amaadịp idem amọ ke adidat afọñiwuod mfʌk anyen amọ. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Adidem akesaña aboiyo, prọfed amaakoot anye, “Afʌnadeen mfo akesịne ke ufọọd ekọñ, ndin awo amaadi ambịne miin adat awo e-ekemʌmmọ ke ekọñ anyʌñ abo, ‘Kpeme ete ami. Anye akpesop, adiido uwem mfo ke uwem amọ, imiidooho ntoro ayaakpe talen silfa keed<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A-adooho ñkpọ nte kilokram 34</char></note>.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Ke ini ayịnufọk mfo asʌkkọ adukpo ndukpo, ete ado amaasop.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Adidem Isrel amaabo, “Ubiideikpe mfo ado ami. Afo amebiide anọ idem mfo.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Ndin prọfed amaasọsọp idem afʌkkọ afọñiwuod ado asio ke anyen amọ, ndin adidem Isrel akịt anye adiọọñọ nte keed ke atu mme prọfed. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Anye amaabo adidem, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Afo ametat asuuk asaña-asaña awo ake ami mmaakebiere ke ana akpa. Ke ntoro uwem mfo ayaakaa ke uwem amọ, mbon mfo ke mbon amọ.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Ke mfʌhọ ye iyadesịd, adidem Isrel amaanyọñ ufọkadidem ke Sameria.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Inwañ Fain Nabọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Akemaanako ñkpọ amaatịppe a-akebañake inwañ fain a-akenieghe Nabọd awo Yesriil. Inwañ fain ado akeba ke Yesriil, akpere ufọk adidem Ehab adidem Sameria. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Ehab amaabo Nabọd, “Yak ami ndat inwañ fain mfo ñkama nnam inwañ ñkọñ, sia akpere ufọkadidem. Ke ukpʌhọ ami ñyaunọ inwañ fain se ifọn ikan anyem, me idooho ntoro, afo ukpuma, ami ñyaukpe ekọmudua se anye akpa.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Ado Nabọd amaabọọrọ Ehab, “<char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akan ami adunọọ fiin udeeme mme eteete mmi.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Ndin Ehab amaanyọñ ufọk, afʌhọ anyʌñ ayat esịd sia Nabọd awo Yesriil amaabo, “Ami nduunọọhọ fiin udeeme mme eteete mmi.” Anye amaasuuk ana ke ñkpana amọ anyʌñ asịn idia ñkpọ.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Anwaan amọ Yesibeel amaadʌk adibịp anye, “Nsoo ido nọ afo afọfʌhọ? Nsoo ido nọ afo umuudiaha ñkpọ?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Anye amaabọọrọ anye, “Sia ami ñkebo Nabọd awo Yesriil, ‘Nyam inwañ fain mfo nnọ miin; ado afo ukpuma, ami ñyaunọ fiin inwañ fain mfen ke itie amọ.’ Ado anye amaabo, ‘Ami nduunọọhọ fiin inwañ fain mmi.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Yesibeel anwaan amọ amaabo, “Ntom ke afo anam nte adidem a-akarake Isrel? Dakka da nyʌñ dia ñkpọ! Daara. Ñyaabọ inwañ fain Nabọd awo Yesriil unọ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Ndin anye amaawet mme ñwed ke anyịñ Ehab, afiik ammọ ke ufiikñkpọ amọ, ndin anọ ammọ esọk mme ñkpisọñ ye mme mbọọñ ekedʌñọke ke abio Nabọd ye anye. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Ke mme ñwed ado anye amaawet:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 21:9">“Inịm usen utreudia inyʌñ item Nabọd ke ñwuọnda itie ke atu mbon awo. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Ado item mme abʌd-abʌd awo iba ke nsakiso amọ inyʌñ inam ammọ edot anye ikọ ebo ke anye asueñ Abasi ye adidem. Ndin isio anye ke anwaesiin inyʌñ itọọñ anye ke itiad tutu anye akpa.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Ndin mme ñkpisọñ ye mbọọñ e-ekedʌñọke ke abio Nabọd emaenam naña Yesibeel aketemme ke mme ñwed ado ake anye akewette anọ ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Ammọ emaenịm utreudia enyʌñ etem Nabọd ke ñwuọnda itie ke atu mbon awo. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Ndin mme abʌd-abʌd awo iba emaedi editie ke nsakiso amọ enyʌñ edot Nabọd ikọ ke iso mbon awo, ete, “Nabọd amaasueñ Abasi ye adidem.” Ndin ammọ emaesio anye ke anwa abio emaenyʌñ etọọñ anye ke itiad tutu anye akpa. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Ndin ammọ emaenọ etob esọk Yesibeel: “Etọọñ Nabọd ke itiad ewot.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Yesibeel akesʌk akokop ke emaetọọñ Nabọd ke itiad ewot, anye amaabo Ehab, “Dakka da ke anyọñ nyʌñ dat inwañ fain Nabọd awo Yesriil akesịnne adinyam unọọ fiin nie. Anye ibaaha aba ke uwem, ado akpa.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Ehab akekop ke Nabọd amaakpa, anye amaadakka anyʌñ akaa adikiben inwañ fain Nabọd awo Yesriil ndat nnie.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Ndin uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaadisịm Elaiya awo Tisbe: <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Kaa kesoobo ye Ehab adidem Isrel, a-akarake Sameria. Anye aba idahami ke inwañ fain Nabọd, a-anye akaaha adidat nnie. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Dọkkọ anye, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Nte afo uwotto awo udat ñkpọ amọ?’ Ndin bo anye, ‘Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: Ke itie ake mme ewa ekedaiya iyiib Nabọd, mme ewa eyaedai iyiib mfo ntoro, ii, ake mfo!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Ehab amaabo Elaiya, “Awuọ afo amediñyaara miin, asua mmi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Anye amaabọọrọ “Ami mmuuyaara fiin, sia afo amenyam idem mfo adinam idiọọk ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />Anye abo, ‘Ami ñyaaben atahade usọk fiin. Ami ñyaasọọk ubon mfo ñnyʌñ ñkpịkke nsio ñkpọñ Ehab afịd akpatre awodeen ke Isrel afʌn me amanaisọñ. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Ñyaanam ufọk mfo atie nte ake Yerobuam ayịn Nebad ye ake Baasa ayịn Ahiya, sia afo amedemme ifiobesịd mmi anyʌñ anam Isrel enam idiọọkñkpọ.’<verse eid="1KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />“Ndin ñko ke abaña Yesibeel <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Mme ewa ediita Yesibeel ke ndibene Yesriil.’<verse eid="1KI 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />“Mme ewa eyaeta mbon se Ehab anie ekpaaha ke abio, ndin mme inuen eyaeta mbon ake ekpaaha ke esịdidʌñ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />(Ikibaaha awo a-aketieghe nte Ehab, a-akenyamma idem amọ adinam idiọọk ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, akeene ndọọñ Yesibeel anwaan amọ. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Anye amaadu ataa abʌd-abʌd uwem ke adikeene mme ubobodñkpọ, nte mbon Amọọ ake <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaakebịne ammọ asio ke iso Isrel.)<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Ke ini Ehab akekoppo mme ikọ ami, anye amaawai afọñ amọ, asịne afọñikpo anyʌñ atie utreudia. Anye amaanaa ke afọñikpo anyʌñ asaña ke nsuukidem.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Ndin ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaasịm Elaiya awo Tisbe: <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Afo amekịt naña Ehab asuuhọ idem amọ ke iso mmi? Sia anye asuuhọke idem amọ, ami ndiinamma afanekọñ ami atịppe ke ayio amọ, ado ñyaanam atịppe ke ufọk amọ ke ayio ayịn amọ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Mikaiya Atañ Prọfesi abaña Ehab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Ke isua ita ekọñ ikibaaha ke ufọọd Aram ye Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Ado ke ayọhọ isua ita Yehosafad adidem Yuda amaakaa adikisoobo ye adidem Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Adidem Isrel amaabo mme adaaha amọ, “Ndufo idiọọñọke ke Ramọd Kilied inie ñnyịn ado ñnyịn inieghe se inam adimaana mbọọ anye nto adidem Aram?”<verse eid="1KI 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Ndin anye amaabịp Yehosafad, “Afo ayañkeene miin akenwana ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Yehosafad amaabọọrọ adidem Isrel, “Ami ntie nte afo, mbon mmi nte mbon mfo, mme enañmbakara mmi nte enañmbakara mfo.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Ado Yehosafad amaanyʌñ abo adidem Isrel, “Ado akpa ñkpọ yem item <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaakoono mme prọfed, ñkpọ nte ideen ikie inaañ (400), anyʌñ abịp ammọ, “Nte ñka ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied, me ntịmme?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Ammọ emaebọọrọ, “Kaa, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaayaak anye asịn ke ubọk adidem.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Ado Yehosafad amaabịp, “Nte prọfed <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ibaaha aba se ñnyịn ikeme ibịp nto?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Adidem Isrel amaabọọrọ Yehosafad, “prọfed keed asʌk aba ake ñnyịn ikemeke adibịp nto <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, ado ami nsuasua anye sia anye isitañña eti ñkpọ ndomokeed imbaña miin, ado asʌk ado idiọọk afịd ini. Anye ado Maikaiya ayịn Imla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Yehosafad amaabọọrọ, “Adidem ikpinaaha atañ utọ ikọ ado.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaakoot keed ke atu mme adaaha amọ amaanyʌñ abo, “Koot Maikaiya ayịn Imla di ini keed.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Ke emaekesịne mme afọñ ubọọñ, adidem Isrel ye Yehosafad adidem Yuda eketie ke mme ebekpo ammọ ke afe ubeek abakpa ke inuaatob Sameria, ye afịd mme prọfed naña esʌk etañ ñkukịd ke iso ammọ. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Ndin Sedekaiya ayịn Kenaana amaanam mme nnʌk ukwak ndin anye amaabo, “Ntom ke <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abo: ‘Ye mme ñkpọ ami afo ayaakuum mbon Aram tutu esobo ammọ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Afịd mme prọfed mbon ñko ekesʌk etañ kpa ukem etob ado. Ammọ emaebo, “Nwana ye Ramọd Kilied nyʌñ bọ edikan, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaayaak anye asịn ke ubọk adidem.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Isʌñutom akekaaha adikoot Maikaiya amaabo anye, “Se afịd mme prọfed mbon ñko, isioho awo eto, esʌk ekịt edikan enọ adidem. Yak ikọ mfo asaña akekem ye ake ammọ, nyʌñ tañ inem-inem ikọ.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Ado Maikaiya amaabo, “Adaña nte <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> aduuho uwem, ami ndiidọkkọ anye se <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> andọkkọ miin kpọd.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Anye amaakedisịm, adidem amaabịp anye, “Maikaiya, nte ñnyịn ika ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied, me ikiikaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Anye amaabọọrọ, “Nwana nyʌñ nie edikan, sia <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ayaayaak anye asịn ke ubọk adidem.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Adidem amaabo anye, “Akañ ifañ ke ana ami nnam nọ afo anwọñọ aditre aditañ ñkpọ ndomokeed ñkan akpanikọ kpọd innọ miin ke anyịñ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Ndin Maikaiya amaabọọrọ, “Ami mmaakịt afịd Isrel naña esuana ke mme abod nte mme edọñ ake imiinieghe akpemeedọñ, ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, ‘Ibon ami inieghe etubom. Yak awo keedekeed anyọñ ufọk amọ ke emem.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Adidem Isrel amaabo Yehosafad, “Ado nte ami ñkudọkkọke mbo ke anye isitañña eti ñkukịd ndomokeed imbaña miin, kpa idiọọk kpọd?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Maikaiya amaakaa iso abo, “Ke ntoro kop ikọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>: Ami mmaakịt <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> naña atie ke ebekpo amọ ye afịd atutu udịm anyọñ naña eda ekanna anye ke nnasia ye ke ufiin. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Ndin <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, ‘Anie awo idiitap Ehab nọ anye aka ekọñ ye Ramọd Kilied anyʌñ aka akekpa ke udo?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:20">“Nsio-nsio awo emaenọ nsio-nsio akikere. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Ke akpatre, sịbidịd amaawuọ adi, akeda ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> ndin amaabo, ‘ami ñyaatap anye.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabịp, “ ‘Ke nsoo utọ usʌñ?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Anye amaabo, “ ‘Ami ñyaakaa ñkedo sịbidịd abiaña ke inua afịd mme prọfed amọ.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">
    <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> amaabo, “ ‘Afo ayaakan aketap anye,’ ‘Kaa nyʌñ kenam ntoro.’<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />“Ndin idahami <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> a-asịn sịbidịd abiaña ke inua afịd mme prọfed mfo ami. <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> abiide nsobo unọ fiin.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Ndin Sedekaiya ayịn Kenaana amaadakka akesiak Maikaiya ufia ke iso. Anye amaabịp, “Usʌñ uke ke sịbidịd a-aketooho <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akekaa idaha anye akentooho miin aditañ ikọ ye afo?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Maikaiya amaabọọrọ, “Afo ayaadiọọñọ ke usen se afo uduukudịbe ke esịd ubeed keed.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Ndin adidem Isrel amaanọ uyio, “Ben Maikaiya nyʌñ nọ anye atịmme abịne Amọn adaukara ke abio ye Yoas ayịn adidem <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />ndin bo, ‘Ntom ke adidem abo: Sịn awo ami ke ñkpakọb ndin kuunyʌñ unọọ anye ñkpọ mfen ukan uyo ye mmọọñ tutu ñnyọñ ndi ke ifuuro.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Maikaiya amaabo, “Afo ukpusʌk unyọñ udi ke ifuuro, awuọ <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> iboiyoke ke ami itañ.” Ndin anye amaadian, “Iwet ikọ mmi inịm, afịd ndufo!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ewot Ehab ke Ramọd Kilied</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Ndin adidem Isrel ye Yehosafad adidem Yuda emaedọọk ekaa Ramọd Kilied. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Adidem Isrel amaabo Yehosafad, “Ami ñyaadedịp idem ndʌk ekọñ, ado afo sịne mme afọñ ubọọñ mfo.” Ndin adidem Isrel amaadịp idem amọ akaa ekọñ.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Akem adidem Aram amaanọ mme adaiso sariọd edịb mme duob mme iba amọ uyio, “Ikiinwana ye awo ndomokeed, etək me ekamba, ibọhọke adidem Isrel.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Ndin mme adaiso sariọd ekekịt Yehosafad, ammọ emaekere, “Ke akpanikọ adidem Isrel adom,” Ndin ammọ emaekanna ebịne anye edinwana ye anye, ado Yehosafad amaasio ñkpo, <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />mme adaiso sariọd ekekịt ke anye idooho adidem Isrel enyʌñ etre edibịne anye.<verse eid="1KI 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Ado awo keed ke idueanyen amaadʌt utịgha amọ anye aketọ adidem Isrel ke ufañ afọñ ekọñ amọ. Adidem amaabo awad sariọd amọ, “Kanna iso nyʌñ mben miin wat sio ke itie anwan ami. Ennọ miin unan.” <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Afịd usen ado ekọñ amaasọñ, ndin emaedịppe adidem ebet ke sariọd amọ anye asakiso ase mbon Aram. Iyiib aketooho unan amọ amaafiọrọ ke isọñ sariọd, ndin ke ndubiayio ado anye amaakpa. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Naña utịn akesoppo, ntuaña amaatara ke atu mbon ekọñ: “Afịd awo enyọñ abio ammọ. Afịd awo enyọñ isọñ ammọ!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Ndin adidem amaakpa emaenyʌñ eben anye edi Sameria, ndin ammọ emaebuuk anye do. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Ammọ emaeyet sariọd ado ke idịm ke Sameria (itie ake mme akpara ekesiyieghe idem), ndin mme ewa emaedai iyiib amọ, kpa naña uyio <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char> akebo.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Ehab, ye afịd se anye akenam, ufọkadidem a-anye akebọppọ anyʌñ abana ye nnʌkeniin, ye mme abio anye akesọọñọke, ado nte awo iwette ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Isrel? <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ehab amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ. Ndin Ahasaiya ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehosafad Adidem Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Yehosafad ayịn Asa amaado adidem Yuda ke ayọhọ isua inaañ ke ukara Ehab adidem Isrel. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehosafad akedo isua edịb mme duob mme ition idaha anye akedooho adidem, ndin anye amaakara ke Yeruselem isua edịb mme ition. Anyịñ eka amọ akedo Asuba ayịn awonwaan Silhi. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Ke afịd ñkpọ anye amaakeene usʌñ ete amọ Asa ikinyʌññọ iwọññọ ikpọñ ammọ; anye amaanam se inen ke iso <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>. Ado, awo ikiwuudo mme ñkoñ-ñkoñ itie; mbon awo ekesʌk ekaka iso enam mme uwa enyʌñ efọp insensi ke ndo. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Yehosafad amaaba ke emem ye adidem Isrel.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Amaado mme ñkpọ mfen ke ukara Yehosafad, mme ñkpọ se anye akenam ye uko a-anye akenieghe ke mme ekọñ, ado nte awo iwette ammọ ke ñwed mbʌkutom mme ndidem Yuda? <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Anye amaasịññe mme ideen akpara ñwommo e-ekesʌhọke ke ukara ete amọ Asa amaakekweeñe. <verse eid="1KI 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Ke ini ado Adidem ikibaaha ke Edọm; adaiwuod ke mme ikpeghe ukara akekara.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Ndin Yehosafad amaabọp udịm nsʌñikañ mbịn utọ ake Taasis edika Ọfia ekedat kold, ado ammọ ikikaaha uwat sia ubom ammọ amaasịp ke Esiọn Keba. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Ke ini ado Ahasaiya ayịn Ehab amaabo Yehosafad, “Yak ideen mmi esio uwat ye mbon mfo,” ado Yehosafad amaasịn.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Akem Yehosafad amaakeduọk adudu ye mme eteete amọ emaenyʌñ ebuuk anye ye ammọ ke abio Defid. Ndin Yehoram ayịn amọ amaadat itie amọ nte adidem.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahasaiya Adidem Isrel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Ahasaiya ayịn Ehab amaado adidem Isrel ke Sameria ke ayọhọ isua duob mme itiaba ukara Yehosafad adidem Yuda, ndin anye amaakara Isrel isua iba. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Anye amaanam idiọọkñkpọ ke anyen <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, sia anye amaakeene usʌñ eka ye ete amọ ye ake Yerobuam ayịn Nebad akenamma Isrel enam idiọọkñkpọ. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Anye amaanam ñkpọ anọ anyʌñ akpono Baal ndin ademme ifiobesịd <char style="nd">Abọọñ</char>, Abasi Isrel, kpa naña ete amọ akenam.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>